1
00:01:31,066 --> 00:01:37,513
[watch ticking]

2
00:01:46,355 --> 00:01:47,522
My cutiepie...

3
00:01:48,908 --> 00:01:50,954
Which watch do you like among these?

4
00:01:59,272 --> 00:02:01,413
I like your watch, Dad.

5
00:02:16,647 --> 00:02:17,686
Look!

6
00:02:19,730 --> 00:02:20,939
My darling Dad!

7
00:02:26,689 --> 00:02:29,428
I only wanted to show
my daughter love forever!

8
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:33,480
I made a mistake, Dad!

9
00:02:35,647 --> 00:02:39,454
Without knowing his true colors,
I held him in the same regard as you!

10
00:02:55,522 --> 00:02:58,940
'Hearty welcome to everyone
who visited Velpuru Fair'

11
00:02:59,147 --> 00:03:01,860
'Along with the rooster fight,
The dice game...'

12
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:07,292
'To begin the Auto race competition,
like never before...'

13
00:03:07,481 --> 00:03:10,866
'Sincere thanks to
our beloved MLA Shri Y. Gold Reddy'

14
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:12,207
'and to our elders...'

15
00:03:12,314 --> 00:03:14,522
'Importantly to our Cop uncles!'

16
00:03:14,689 --> 00:03:16,272
'Greetings, sir! Thanks!'

17
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,393
Hey, how long are you going to take?
Pull it!

18
00:03:19,503 --> 00:03:21,302
Almost, done.

19
00:03:21,387 --> 00:03:23,762
We have to somehow
defeat that Raju this time...

20
00:03:23,915 --> 00:03:27,383
and prove that Velpuru guys
about the rage of Relangi men!

21
00:03:27,926 --> 00:03:29,594
We shall!

22
00:03:40,305 --> 00:03:42,305
[groans] Ah!

23
00:03:42,645 --> 00:03:44,643
- Hey, where's Juvva?
- Brother?

24
00:03:45,132 --> 00:03:48,193
Is he already on the stage?
Sharp fellow! Tie it.

25
00:03:48,263 --> 00:03:50,625
Should I sabotage his auto-rickshaw's
brakes without getting caught?

26
00:03:50,703 --> 00:03:51,689
[laughing]

27
00:03:51,855 --> 00:03:55,522
First check whether the brakes of our
vehicle are working. Sabotaging brakes!

28
00:04:03,730 --> 00:04:05,270
'Important notice to everyone'

29
00:04:05,647 --> 00:04:10,897
'The winner of this auto race...
will receive a cash prize of 50,000'

30
00:04:11,064 --> 00:04:12,689
'Kindly, pay attention!'

31
00:04:12,855 --> 00:04:16,855
'Winner also gets, CM Medal,
booze with boiled peanuts!'

32
00:04:16,897 --> 00:04:17,790
Well done... Well done...

33
00:04:17,850 --> 00:04:20,230
'To make this
competition more thrilling...'

34
00:04:20,293 --> 00:04:22,401
'we've made it tougher this time.'

35
00:04:22,819 --> 00:04:24,146
'There will be three rounds in this race.'

36
00:04:24,219 --> 00:04:26,798
'The first round is
through sand barriers...'

37
00:04:26,931 --> 00:04:28,972
'The second round goes
through bundles of grass...'

38
00:04:29,090 --> 00:04:33,757
'And the final round
crosses fields and ponds!'

39
00:04:33,976 --> 00:04:37,851
'Whoever clears all three rounds
first will be declared the winner.'

40
00:04:38,897 --> 00:04:42,022
'Hello, drivers,
are you ready on your engines?'

41
00:04:42,244 --> 00:04:44,095
[whistling and cheering]

42
00:04:44,625 --> 00:04:45,711
Huh!

43
00:04:46,546 --> 00:04:47,553
Hit it!

44
00:04:47,636 --> 00:04:48,886
- Keep moving!
- Faster!

45
00:04:54,705 --> 00:04:55,744
[unclear speech]

46
00:05:02,313 --> 00:05:04,313
[vocalizing]

47
00:05:04,591 --> 00:05:05,230
Huh!

48
00:05:05,313 --> 00:05:06,521
- Come on, keep going
- Are they coming?

49
00:05:07,178 --> 00:05:08,368
[howling]

50
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,453
Hold still

51
00:05:09,635 --> 00:05:13,022
[indistinctive chatter]

52
00:05:13,228 --> 00:05:14,996
[crowd cheering]

53
00:05:15,083 --> 00:05:16,563
- [howling]
- Well done!

54
00:05:16,643 --> 00:05:17,925
- Well done!
- Get down!

55
00:05:18,105 --> 00:05:18,980
Hey, get down!

56
00:05:19,109 --> 00:05:21,943
- I won't, man.
- Don't you want CM medal? Get down!

57
00:05:22,088 --> 00:05:23,992
- Oh! I came for the sake of that!
- Push it! Push it!

58
00:05:24,056 --> 00:05:26,471
- CM Medal! CM Medal!
- [groaning]

59
00:05:26,579 --> 00:05:27,617
Hit it!

60
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:39,046
- CM Medal!
- [in unison]: Yes, hit the engine! Go on!

61
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,939
Keep moving!

62
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:52,940
[crowd whistling and cheering]

63
00:05:57,135 --> 00:05:59,094
Keep moving! Come on!

64
00:05:59,529 --> 00:06:01,629
CM Medal is on line, hit it!

65
00:06:10,905 --> 00:06:12,155
Don't stop keep moving

66
00:06:12,355 --> 00:06:16,419
- Watch out! Careful!
- Move aside! Not now!

67
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,553
Just missed it, man!

68
00:06:17,628 --> 00:06:18,735
Hey, is there a way out?

69
00:06:18,846 --> 00:06:20,637
This is shortcut, keep going

70
00:06:29,058 --> 00:06:31,270
Hey, you said it's a shortcut,
but this is going into the Godavari!

71
00:06:31,349 --> 00:06:32,587
Take it easy, Bro. We're here.

72
00:06:39,901 --> 00:06:40,996
Brother...

73
00:06:42,267 --> 00:06:44,840
Listen up, the fresh news is...

74
00:06:45,022 --> 00:06:47,232
Sattibabu from Athilli,
is on third position!

75
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:48,336
[crowd cheering]

76
00:06:51,687 --> 00:06:54,562
Robert from Relangi,
is on second position!

77
00:06:59,314 --> 00:07:02,772
And, our Raju from Velupuru
is on first position

78
00:07:07,261 --> 00:07:08,920
Stay tuned for more details

79
00:07:09,111 --> 00:07:09,888
Yeah, keep chewing!

80
00:07:09,934 --> 00:07:12,090
Brother,
we must not let Relangi's pride down!

81
00:07:12,157 --> 00:07:13,562
[indistinctive chatter]
[laughing]

82
00:07:13,718 --> 00:07:15,426
How was that, guys?

83
00:07:15,772 --> 00:07:16,946
Wastrels!

84
00:07:17,090 --> 00:07:18,307
He stopped there. Keep moving!

85
00:07:18,415 --> 00:07:20,207
- Why did you stop?
- Where are you going now?

86
00:07:20,238 --> 00:07:21,452
- Look at them!
- CM medal, dude!

87
00:07:21,589 --> 00:07:22,607
Come on, push!

88
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,331
[music mutes voice]

89
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:27,387
These are common in the race, hop in

90
00:07:27,572 --> 00:07:30,320
- Keep moving! Come on!
- We shouldn't miss the medal!

91
00:07:33,374 --> 00:07:34,149
[laughing]

92
00:07:34,283 --> 00:07:38,143
Why's he slowing the vehicle down?
Don't make a fool of us!

93
00:07:38,877 --> 00:07:41,058
- What is it?
- Go faster, it's CM medal on the line!

94
00:07:44,911 --> 00:07:48,050
Do you think you're some kind
of Godman to show mercy on them?

95
00:07:48,168 --> 00:07:49,597
[indistinct chatter]

96
00:07:50,088 --> 00:07:54,248
[indistinct commentary]

97
00:07:54,395 --> 00:07:56,021
Come on! Cross the line!

98
00:07:56,767 --> 00:08:00,829
'And against all expectations,
Sattibabu has won this year's race!'

99
00:08:01,056 --> 00:08:03,655
'Congratulations, Satti Babu!'

100
00:08:04,989 --> 00:08:06,002
What is this?

101
00:08:06,107 --> 00:08:10,263
- Bro, it's winner winner chicken dinner!
- You lost it at last moment

102
00:08:10,361 --> 00:08:12,027
- 'Now our MLA...'
- Hey!

103
00:08:12,136 --> 00:08:14,053
- I won't bow down!
- 'will falicitate Satti Babu.'

104
00:08:20,691 --> 00:08:22,072
[indistinct commentary]

105
00:08:22,159 --> 00:08:23,399
- Applause!
- Here!

106
00:08:24,454 --> 00:08:27,537
'Now, the MLA will handover
the Cheque for 50 grand!'

107
00:08:28,610 --> 00:08:31,036
- What are you watching? Hold it.
- Collect that CM Medal too, man.

108
00:08:31,096 --> 00:08:33,045
- Hold it, properly. There's booze!
- Where's the bottle?

109
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:33,933
- It's here!
- Come on!

110
00:08:33,966 --> 00:08:36,298
- Why do you want to see it now?
- Hey, that's my booze!

111
00:08:36,389 --> 00:08:37,766
Start the autorickshaw! Come on!

112
00:08:37,839 --> 00:08:39,070
Look how he snatched it!

113
00:08:39,189 --> 00:08:41,564
- How do I know, brother?
- Are you shocked?

114
00:08:41,814 --> 00:08:43,272
[booing]
Oh my!

115
00:08:43,747 --> 00:08:45,035
Oh damn!

116
00:08:46,732 --> 00:08:48,898
- Want some?
- No, I want only this

117
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:55,040
We got another 'R' in our
OscaRRR gang, man!

118
00:08:55,242 --> 00:08:56,326
What do you say, Robert?

119
00:08:58,939 --> 00:09:03,396
[music]

120
00:09:03,698 --> 00:09:04,784
"BRIDEGROOM" SALOON

121
00:09:06,681 --> 00:09:07,871
Get to work, man

122
00:09:10,332 --> 00:09:11,832
I wonder when would I get married!

123
00:09:12,455 --> 00:09:13,479
You look charming!

124
00:09:14,185 --> 00:09:15,613
It smells so tempting!

125
00:09:17,975 --> 00:09:21,248
Relangi, Athili, Manchili, Aravalli...
come and board...

126
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:24,314
the auto to Bhimavaram
Engineering College is here, hop on!

127
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:28,480
<i>♪ This is my village… ♪</i>
<i>♪ my home, my world. ♪</i>

128
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:33,966
<i>♪ A place filled with beauty and joy. ♪</i>

129
00:09:34,826 --> 00:09:36,578
Mary's house is here

130
00:09:37,553 --> 00:09:40,845
Granny, here's some country
chicken biryani... enjoy naughtily!

131
00:09:41,022 --> 00:09:46,814
How dare you call me like that,
without any respect for my age!

132
00:09:46,897 --> 00:09:49,068
This oldie can't tell a
joke from a comment!

133
00:09:49,125 --> 00:09:50,776
The video has come out good, have a look.

134
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:54,105
<i>♪ Every corner blooms with colours. ♪</i>

135
00:09:54,272 --> 00:09:55,480
Move aside, man!

136
00:09:56,054 --> 00:09:57,702
<i>♪ This soil holds my roots deep within. ♪</i>

137
00:09:57,780 --> 00:09:59,947
- Hey, a tractor, hit the brakes!
- One second!

138
00:10:02,025 --> 00:10:02,919
What, man?

139
00:10:03,147 --> 00:10:07,757
<i>♪ This place holds a ♪</i>
<i>♪ magic no other place has! ♪</i>

140
00:10:08,001 --> 00:10:13,166
<i>♪ A person who breathes this ♪</i>
<i>♪ pure air will live a complete life! ♪</i>

141
00:10:13,389 --> 00:10:18,618
<i>♪ The flora, ♪</i>
<i>♪ fauna and these people are my own. ♪</i>

142
00:10:18,809 --> 00:10:20,809
<i>♪ This is my village… ♪</i>

143
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:25,355
Oh my! Chicks!

144
00:10:27,245 --> 00:10:29,661
<i>♪ Wonder where you came all way from, ♪</i>
<i>♪ bumblebee? ♪</i>

145
00:10:29,948 --> 00:10:32,573
<i>♪ What made you come here, bumblebee? ♪</i>

146
00:10:32,814 --> 00:10:37,939
<i>♪ Did the flowers ooze honey for you ♪</i>
<i>♪ or were you attracted by the honey? ♪</i>

147
00:10:38,314 --> 00:10:43,605
<i>♪ Weren't you able to find the purest, ♪</i>
<i>♪ nicest, finest honey? ♪</i>

148
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:46,460
<i>♪ You, little bumblebee. ♪</i>

149
00:10:46,619 --> 00:10:48,414
[women laughing]

150
00:10:49,235 --> 00:10:50,272
Got any lemon juice?

151
00:10:50,452 --> 00:10:51,373
[breathing out heavily]

152
00:10:51,471 --> 00:10:52,992
- Hey! Come, run!
- I feel so dehydrated.

153
00:10:53,056 --> 00:10:55,056
- Come on, man! Hit a four or a six!
- Run!

154
00:10:55,081 --> 00:10:55,897
My legs are aching.

155
00:10:55,921 --> 00:10:57,347
Get me some soft drink at least!

156
00:10:57,665 --> 00:11:03,288
[vocalizing]

157
00:11:03,459 --> 00:11:07,802
[vocalizing]

158
00:11:08,473 --> 00:11:11,272
[upbeat music]

159
00:11:11,453 --> 00:11:15,186
[music mutes voices]

160
00:11:15,418 --> 00:11:19,418
[vocalizing]

161
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:24,861
<i>♪ Wherever I am inside the ♪</i>
<i>♪ four walls of my house... ♪</i>

162
00:11:25,238 --> 00:11:29,271
<i>♪ I consider the world as my abode. ♪</i>

163
00:11:30,662 --> 00:11:33,648
- Why are you heading back so early?
- I'm married, dude, I've to go!

164
00:11:33,747 --> 00:11:34,413
Do take care!

165
00:11:34,564 --> 00:11:37,825
I'm starving. I've been roaming around
since morning. Give me something to eat!

166
00:11:37,971 --> 00:11:39,417
Can't you see I'm busy?

167
00:11:39,537 --> 00:11:40,769
- Go serve yourself.
- Damn!

168
00:11:41,436 --> 00:11:46,707
<i>♪ I'll move along, ♪</i>
<i>♪ stick beside and give you strength. ♪</i>

169
00:11:47,522 --> 00:11:52,605
<i>♪ Sharing the journey of my life ♪</i>
<i>♪ with everyone and sharing love to all. ♪</i>

170
00:11:52,814 --> 00:11:58,022
<i>♪ Helping others without ♪</i>
<i>♪ expecting are my constant wheels. ♪</i>

171
00:11:58,355 --> 00:12:04,223
<i>♪ Whatever may happen, wharever it ♪</i>
<i>♪ might take me, I care for everyone. ♪</i>

172
00:12:06,554 --> 00:12:11,213
<i>♪ This is my village… ♪</i>
<i>♪ my home, my world. ♪</i>

173
00:12:12,114 --> 00:12:16,680
<i>♪ A place filled with beauty and joy. ♪</i>

174
00:12:16,972 --> 00:12:21,936
<i>♪ Every corner blooms with ♪</i>
<i>♪ colours in the spacious houses. ♪</i>

175
00:12:22,313 --> 00:12:27,825
<i>♪ Great times bonded ♪</i>
<i>♪ by relations everywhere. ♪</i>

176
00:12:28,290 --> 00:12:29,832
What's up, Uncle? Leaving so soon?

177
00:12:30,024 --> 00:12:33,649
Do you think everyone's
as hardworking as your dad?

178
00:12:34,069 --> 00:12:35,676
Take these sugarcanes. Enjoy them.

179
00:12:35,810 --> 00:12:37,819
Enough of pulling my leg,
keep moving, man

180
00:12:39,713 --> 00:12:44,924
<i>♪ The flora, ♪</i>
<i>♪ fauna and these people are my own. ♪</i>

181
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:47,462
<i>♪ This is my village… ♪</i>

182
00:12:49,846 --> 00:12:52,174
What's wrong with Rahman?
Can't he stop flirting with girls?

183
00:12:52,393 --> 00:12:55,605
You stop worrying about him and
start chopping these onions first.

184
00:12:55,886 --> 00:12:56,732
Look at them, Dad...

185
00:12:56,855 --> 00:12:59,122
Both the mother and son are
making me do all the work!

186
00:12:59,267 --> 00:13:01,680
Whenever you need to work,
you'll go complain to your dad

187
00:13:08,967 --> 00:13:10,040
[music mutes voice]

188
00:13:13,323 --> 00:13:17,015
That's how Satyabhama's pride
faded before Rukmini's devotion

189
00:13:17,187 --> 00:13:19,977
I really wish you'd get
a wife like Satyabhama...

190
00:13:20,103 --> 00:13:22,644
so she can bash you every day!

191
00:13:24,268 --> 00:13:26,592
If you don't do any work,

192
00:13:26,735 --> 00:13:29,725
your husband will give you a proper whack!

193
00:13:30,406 --> 00:13:32,638
- Hey, wait up, I'll see your end
- Hey... Hey...

194
00:13:33,178 --> 00:13:34,261
Hey, hold up

195
00:13:34,378 --> 00:13:35,598
Yesh, at your service!

196
00:13:42,045 --> 00:13:44,794
[birds chirping]

197
00:13:55,157 --> 00:13:57,334
- Bye, Dad!
- Take care, dear

198
00:14:00,554 --> 00:14:01,567
How are you, Lakshmi?

199
00:14:01,621 --> 00:14:03,238
I'm good, brother-in-law, and you?

200
00:14:03,314 --> 00:14:04,874
- I'm fine.
- Yeah, you'll be fine anyway.

201
00:14:05,061 --> 00:14:07,144
How are you, nephew?
How's everything?

202
00:14:07,405 --> 00:14:08,445
Awesome!

203
00:14:08,829 --> 00:14:12,079
What about you? You're looking so
energetic, colouring your hair!

204
00:14:12,408 --> 00:14:13,492
Isn't your wife at home?

205
00:14:13,655 --> 00:14:16,176
She's attending a function
in the neighboring village.

206
00:14:16,455 --> 00:14:17,931
She'll be back by tonight.

207
00:14:18,038 --> 00:14:19,621
So you'll be on fire the whole day!

208
00:14:19,788 --> 00:14:20,933
Oh come on! Get going!

209
00:14:21,830 --> 00:14:24,171
Why aren't you coming to my place,
brother-in-law?

210
00:14:24,455 --> 00:14:27,205
You should've come with
your parents the other day

211
00:14:27,371 --> 00:14:29,621
When they visited, they brought mangoes.

212
00:14:29,913 --> 00:14:31,120
I've been eating them daily,

213
00:14:31,246 --> 00:14:32,538
do you know how good they taste?

214
00:14:32,746 --> 00:14:34,753
I gave flowers to your mother.
Did she use them?

215
00:14:35,038 --> 00:14:37,051
[yapping continously]

216
00:14:37,518 --> 00:14:39,192
Lakshmi, slow down a bit

217
00:14:39,413 --> 00:14:40,738
At least take a breath!

218
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:42,711
- Always blabbering.
- I don't know, brother-in-law...

219
00:14:42,804 --> 00:14:45,929
When I see you, words just flow out!

220
00:14:46,102 --> 00:14:48,602
I start yapping like an idiot...

221
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:50,661
All that aside...

222
00:14:50,913 --> 00:14:53,474
Why aren't there many
people in your auto today?

223
00:14:53,663 --> 00:14:55,267
Isn't business going well?

224
00:14:55,396 --> 00:14:58,324
[women giggling]

225
00:14:58,580 --> 00:15:00,936
He's my brother-in-law,
a really nice guy.

226
00:15:01,041 --> 00:15:02,374
I wait for his auto every day.

227
00:15:02,413 --> 00:15:03,246
It's always full.

228
00:15:03,346 --> 00:15:06,320
Today the auto wasn't full,
so I thought maybe the business is thin!

229
00:15:06,496 --> 00:15:09,288
I'm serious, brother-in-law,
I wasn't joking.

230
00:15:09,449 --> 00:15:10,564
Hey, stop!

231
00:15:10,769 --> 00:15:12,275
WELCOME
VILLAGE PANCHAYAT, MANCHILI

232
00:15:12,330 --> 00:15:13,105
Careful

233
00:15:13,189 --> 00:15:14,647
- Bro... bro...
- What is it?

234
00:15:15,038 --> 00:15:18,705
You go ahead for today,
I've got work to do

235
00:15:18,871 --> 00:15:20,801
- What's that?
- Well... Err...

236
00:15:21,830 --> 00:15:23,913
I'm going to a movie with my girlfriend.

237
00:15:24,038 --> 00:15:25,467
You said the same thing last time.

238
00:15:25,501 --> 00:15:28,417
- Last time the theatre was packed!
- Alright.

239
00:15:29,288 --> 00:15:30,581
Fine, go to that movie then!

240
00:15:30,868 --> 00:15:32,833
- Won't anyone be there?
- Probably only the producer himself.

241
00:15:32,907 --> 00:15:33,805
Move aside!

242
00:15:33,830 --> 00:15:35,261
Raju brother, I'll meet you tomorrow.

243
00:15:35,363 --> 00:15:36,599
Keep going

244
00:15:36,673 --> 00:15:38,013
What, Mahalakshmi!
How are you?

245
00:15:38,151 --> 00:15:39,504
You've boarded our
auto after so many days.

246
00:15:39,664 --> 00:15:41,325
I'm fine, boy!

247
00:15:41,461 --> 00:15:44,265
If you cover the whole seat,
where will my brother-in-law sit?

248
00:15:44,371 --> 00:15:47,246
Well, I'm just sitting beside him,
not on his lap!

249
00:15:47,306 --> 00:15:50,265
Look how awkwardly
he's driving because of you!

250
00:15:50,408 --> 00:15:51,667
- Have some sense! Damn!
- Hey!

251
00:15:51,996 --> 00:15:54,651
Hey, why did you give her a ride?
She's driving me crazy.

252
00:15:57,618 --> 00:15:58,893
- Bye, brother-in-law!
- Bye.

253
00:15:58,975 --> 00:16:00,320
Convey my regards
to aunty and uncle.

254
00:16:00,403 --> 00:16:01,417
- Bye
- Bye

255
00:16:02,013 --> 00:16:03,685
- Good god!
- Oh wait, I forgot...

256
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,180
convey my regards
to your sister too

257
00:16:05,234 --> 00:16:06,705
- Alright, get lost.
- You get lost.

258
00:16:06,744 --> 00:16:08,035
He is a bad influence
on my brother-in-law!

259
00:16:08,078 --> 00:16:09,340
Why are you laughing?

260
00:16:09,538 --> 00:16:11,830
Ignore her, she's crazy.

261
00:16:12,038 --> 00:16:13,330
[burst of amused laughter]

262
00:16:13,496 --> 00:16:15,541
What's with that stare?
As if she's some big shot!

263
00:16:15,629 --> 00:16:16,635
[groans]

264
00:16:16,732 --> 00:16:18,273
You look really good

265
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:20,453
What does your dad do?
Where are you from?

266
00:16:21,540 --> 00:16:23,623
I lied to her.
Actually you're the good-looking one!

267
00:16:23,799 --> 00:16:26,369
Anyone beside you
will be dominated by your charm

268
00:16:26,941 --> 00:16:29,015
- Ah!
- Oh no! You've ruined it.

269
00:16:30,467 --> 00:16:32,569
- Hey get lost!
- You get lost!

270
00:16:32,705 --> 00:16:34,621
- Stop your tantrums!
- Remove your sunglasses and drive

271
00:16:35,413 --> 00:16:37,371
What happened, Uncle?
What's the issue?

272
00:16:38,331 --> 00:16:39,384
Well...

273
00:16:40,038 --> 00:16:42,323
he ran his vehicle over my hen.

274
00:16:42,694 --> 00:16:44,122
Of course he paid 10 grand.

275
00:16:44,371 --> 00:16:45,955
It looks like a rooster hen.

276
00:16:46,163 --> 00:16:47,246
10k is cheap...

277
00:16:47,330 --> 00:16:49,413
in our village we'd get 25k for it.

278
00:16:49,454 --> 00:16:52,282
Uncle, he apologised and he paid.

279
00:16:52,509 --> 00:16:53,076
Let him go.

280
00:16:53,192 --> 00:16:54,403
How can we leave it?

281
00:16:54,562 --> 00:16:56,638
Uncle pampered that hen...

282
00:16:56,796 --> 00:16:58,046
look how upset he is!

283
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:01,463
No one is moving from
here until this is sorted.

284
00:17:01,621 --> 00:17:03,427
- The money has to come
- Hey, shut the heck up!

285
00:17:03,633 --> 00:17:04,647
Stop making a scene...

286
00:17:04,705 --> 00:17:05,996
the whole road is blocked.

287
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:08,538
Why do you always cause trouble?
Move from here!

288
00:17:08,703 --> 00:17:10,207
- Come, bro.
- Who are you to order me?

289
00:17:10,371 --> 00:17:12,371
- Who the heck are you?
- What did you just say?

290
00:17:12,413 --> 00:17:15,090
I'll say it, I'm speaking
for Uncle's sake.

291
00:17:15,288 --> 00:17:17,705
You yourself aware
of half context.

292
00:17:17,746 --> 00:17:19,351
I'm not moving from
here till this is sorted.

293
00:17:19,455 --> 00:17:21,663
- Are you mad?
- Yes, I am!

294
00:17:21,751 --> 00:17:22,709
I love Uncle...

295
00:17:22,830 --> 00:17:24,544
- Mad about Uncle!
- So what?

296
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:27,038
Are you nuts? The traffic is blocked.

297
00:17:27,113 --> 00:17:30,113
Uncle's hen deserves its full worth,
period!

298
00:17:30,246 --> 00:17:32,288
Why are you creating a
scene by stopping the vehicles?

299
00:17:32,591 --> 00:17:34,803
Why are you making a fuss over a mere hen?

300
00:17:34,996 --> 00:17:37,705
I'll go bonkers, man! I'm a animal lover!

301
00:17:37,824 --> 00:17:39,449
I'll even stop the
rockets till this get solved.

302
00:17:39,663 --> 00:17:41,788
Are you freaking nuts or what?
Keep moving

303
00:17:41,950 --> 00:17:43,658
We ain't gonna move
from here till our hen get justice

304
00:17:43,815 --> 00:17:45,371
[laughing]

305
00:17:47,538 --> 00:17:49,413
- Clear the traffic!
- Why did she slap me?

306
00:17:49,496 --> 00:17:51,038
We're getting late for college.

307
00:18:01,746 --> 00:18:03,147
My Satyabhama…

308
00:18:03,948 --> 00:18:05,185
My Mumtaz!

309
00:18:12,871 --> 00:18:14,081
Come on, get going!

310
00:18:15,631 --> 00:18:16,830
Bro, our passengers are gone!

311
00:18:16,913 --> 00:18:18,774
My girl is leaving, hit the gas!

312
00:18:18,913 --> 00:18:20,140
Move! Fast!

313
00:18:20,444 --> 00:18:25,225
[music]

314
00:18:39,761 --> 00:18:41,171
She's from our college, bro

315
00:18:41,266 --> 00:18:43,141
She's eating the biryani I made!

316
00:18:43,455 --> 00:18:48,059
<i>♪ The instant her hand ♪</i>
<i>♪ brushed over my cheek... ♪</i>

317
00:18:48,580 --> 00:18:52,692
<i>♪ First love stirred ♪</i>
<i>♪ quietly in my heart. ♪</i>

318
00:18:52,870 --> 00:18:55,196
Hey, I need the blueprint of the college.

319
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,757
Damn you! Check that side!

320
00:18:58,288 --> 00:19:00,308
- Go that way!
- Oh! Bullsat!

321
00:19:00,611 --> 00:19:03,852
<i>♪ She has given me a sweeet pain. ♪</i>

322
00:19:04,256 --> 00:19:08,840
<i>♪ Before her beauty, ♪</i>
<i>♪ I melted into thin air. ♪</i>

323
00:19:08,996 --> 00:19:15,979
[upbeat music]

324
00:19:19,455 --> 00:19:24,306
<i>♪ Feel how my heart pounds... ♪</i>
<i>♪ like a great drum echoing. ♪</i>

325
00:19:24,621 --> 00:19:29,432
<i>♪ This feeling is like never before, ♪</i>
<i>♪ is this what they call love? ♪</i>

326
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:38,830
- Knock it off, please. Go.
- Take him away from here!

327
00:19:38,935 --> 00:19:39,813
Please go.

328
00:19:39,871 --> 00:19:42,705
Thanks, man,
otherwise she would've eaten me alive.

329
00:19:43,038 --> 00:19:44,972
Damn it…
I see her everywhere.

330
00:19:46,413 --> 00:19:48,119
Hey, did you see her?

331
00:19:49,330 --> 00:19:52,330
You sent me towards your sister's
class and now you saw her alone?

332
00:19:54,631 --> 00:19:55,839
Why the heck
you are laughing?

333
00:19:56,480 --> 00:20:00,624
<i>♪ Her laughter cracks like thunder. ♪</i>

334
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:06,211
<i>♪ suddenly the world ♪</i>
<i>♪ shimmers with light. ♪</i>

335
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:14,045
<i>♪ When she stands before me... ♪</i>

336
00:20:14,705 --> 00:20:18,977
<i>♪ The feeling I get is precious! ♪</i>

337
00:20:19,455 --> 00:20:24,200
<i>♪ I'm awestruck... unable to believe ♪</i>
<i>♪ this is an unexpected change. ♪</i>

338
00:20:24,705 --> 00:20:29,705
<i>♪ Love was etched deeply at first sight. ♪</i>

339
00:20:30,331 --> 00:20:34,681
<i>♪ Before her beauty, ♪</i>
<i>♪ I melted into thin air. ♪</i>

340
00:20:35,121 --> 00:20:39,614
[upbeat music]

341
00:20:42,205 --> 00:20:45,538
[vocalizing]

342
00:20:45,705 --> 00:20:50,188
<i>♪ Feel how my heart pounds... ♪</i>
<i>♪ like a great drum echoing. ♪</i>

343
00:20:50,788 --> 00:20:55,959
<i>♪ This feeling is like never before, ♪</i>
<i>♪ is this what they call love? ♪</i>

344
00:20:57,014 --> 00:20:59,400
Hey, wait!
I had a back spasm even in my dreams.

345
00:21:01,580 --> 00:21:02,641
- Time's up.
- Oh, Time's up!

346
00:21:05,413 --> 00:21:06,480
Damn!

347
00:21:13,697 --> 00:21:15,006
[vocalizing]

348
00:21:19,261 --> 00:21:20,441
[vocalizing]

349
00:21:22,038 --> 00:21:23,873
Oh God, I guess she's surprised.

350
00:21:24,609 --> 00:21:26,038
Does she remember the
slap from this morning?

351
00:21:26,113 --> 00:21:28,396
Aren't you supposed to leave now?
What are you still doing here?

352
00:21:29,646 --> 00:21:30,684
Tell her.

353
00:21:30,942 --> 00:21:32,604
Yeah, just for you!

354
00:21:32,705 --> 00:21:35,871
Since you take different
autorickshaws everyday...

355
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:39,861
It's true... Tell her!

356
00:21:40,996 --> 00:21:42,990
Samaikya,
are you done writing the analog record?

357
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:44,611
Almost completed.

358
00:21:44,912 --> 00:21:47,871
She's looking somewhere else
so she doesn't even remember us.

359
00:21:48,038 --> 00:21:49,331
- Is that so?
- Yes

360
00:21:50,350 --> 00:21:52,100
By the way,
Who is she?

361
00:21:52,314 --> 00:21:53,492
Raju, he's my brother.

362
00:21:53,819 --> 00:21:55,086
Consider him your brother too!

363
00:21:55,496 --> 00:21:57,059
Rahman, my brother's friend

364
00:21:57,330 --> 00:21:58,569
Maya, she's my close friend

365
00:21:58,705 --> 00:22:00,162
Hi, that is Rahman

366
00:22:02,566 --> 00:22:03,571
Hop in

367
00:22:06,830 --> 00:22:08,822
Why is your sister nagging her?

368
00:22:09,038 --> 00:22:09,746
[indistinct chatter]

369
00:22:09,871 --> 00:22:11,256
Hey, play some songs!

370
00:22:12,402 --> 00:22:19,310
[old Telugu song playing]

371
00:22:20,033 --> 00:22:21,738
Hey, she didn't even glance at us!

372
00:22:23,205 --> 00:22:25,663
Let me handle the playlist now!
She'll fall for it instantly.

373
00:22:25,899 --> 00:22:32,829
[Telugu song playing]

374
00:22:34,455 --> 00:22:35,918
You useless piece of crap!

375
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:38,188
- Love you, darling!
- Can't you able to drive properly?

376
00:22:38,355 --> 00:22:45,280
[Telugu song playing]

377
00:22:49,496 --> 00:22:50,783
Idiot, knock it off!

378
00:22:50,877 --> 00:22:53,375
[Telugu song playing]

379
00:22:53,521 --> 00:22:59,036
[Telugu song playing]
[buffalo grunting]

380
00:22:59,580 --> 00:23:02,371
My heart belongs to this Mumtaz

381
00:23:03,080 --> 00:23:04,240
He deserved that

382
00:23:06,246 --> 00:23:07,425
Stop the music!

383
00:23:08,080 --> 00:23:11,996
The moment Maya's softy hands...

384
00:23:12,163 --> 00:23:14,480
touched my rough cheeks…

385
00:23:14,996 --> 00:23:16,738
I felt it that very moment!

386
00:23:17,288 --> 00:23:19,338
I felt that touch, dude.

387
00:23:19,900 --> 00:23:21,093
[frog croaking]

388
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:27,131
You guys won't understand

389
00:23:27,258 --> 00:23:28,371
Useless feelings

390
00:23:28,493 --> 00:23:34,184
She touched my cheeks twice
only because she has feelings for me.

391
00:23:34,413 --> 00:23:35,600
Where is she from?

392
00:23:36,496 --> 00:23:37,528
Your village, Relangi.

393
00:23:37,788 --> 00:23:39,055
Relangi's son-in-law, right here

394
00:23:39,139 --> 00:23:43,290
<i>♪ Relangi's son-in-law, ♪</i>
<i>♪ the one and only! ♪</i>

395
00:23:43,871 --> 00:23:48,167
Hope she isn't Maya,
the daughter of security guard Sam Babu?

396
00:23:48,496 --> 00:23:49,239
Oh God...

397
00:23:49,371 --> 00:23:51,612
I'm scared,
save me!

398
00:23:52,163 --> 00:23:53,519
You idiot!

399
00:23:54,288 --> 00:23:55,779
He's just Sam Babu...

400
00:23:55,871 --> 00:23:58,330
why are you acting as if he is
some villain from the movies?

401
00:23:58,621 --> 00:23:59,996
Indeed, he's right!

402
00:24:00,163 --> 00:24:02,043
Babu sir, I salute you

403
00:24:02,455 --> 00:24:04,705
You gave berth to intoxicating Maya

404
00:24:04,830 --> 00:24:06,290
sorry, you gave birth to Maya

405
00:24:06,496 --> 00:24:08,246
Thank you from the bottom of my heart

406
00:24:08,371 --> 00:24:10,746
Oh my, couldn't you find anyone else?

407
00:24:10,913 --> 00:24:12,705
- Yeah…
- They're from my church!

408
00:24:12,785 --> 00:24:14,952
- Good to know!
- Her father is very strict

409
00:24:15,181 --> 00:24:16,967
Dude, it's Rahman!

410
00:24:17,330 --> 00:24:19,558
- Just chill!
- You don't know about him.

411
00:24:19,664 --> 00:24:21,406
Let me tell you... look there.

412
00:24:21,658 --> 00:24:22,744
Eh?

413
00:24:22,913 --> 00:24:25,363
You have to watch this flashback, look!

414
00:24:26,207 --> 00:24:28,651
No, not from here, from here.

415
00:24:32,305 --> 00:24:38,368
[humming]

416
00:24:38,518 --> 00:24:41,813
[humming]

417
00:24:44,370 --> 00:24:45,411
Is it falling?

418
00:24:52,496 --> 00:24:54,288
With that serious face...

419
00:24:54,955 --> 00:24:56,455
Riding his Splendor bike...

420
00:24:57,038 --> 00:24:59,650
Even people who were peeing
would freeze at the sound of his bike

421
00:24:59,850 --> 00:25:01,941
Splendor engines don't
make that much noise, right?

422
00:25:02,038 --> 00:25:04,663
Shut your logic,
I'll shove the silencer in you!

423
00:25:04,847 --> 00:25:07,218
What does "Freeze" means?
Would he hit them?

424
00:25:07,330 --> 00:25:09,455
- No, bro
- Would he scold them?

425
00:25:09,871 --> 00:25:11,004
No, bro.

426
00:25:11,413 --> 00:25:14,823
Will he do black magic or what?

427
00:25:15,121 --> 00:25:16,206
What are you talking?

428
00:25:16,388 --> 00:25:19,513
Why would all the people stop peeing?

429
00:25:19,584 --> 00:25:21,252
They could pee peacefully, right?

430
00:25:21,580 --> 00:25:22,871
I'll explain it in your way...

431
00:25:23,040 --> 00:25:25,707
In the film Hitler, Chiranjeevi
enters on an Enfield bike...

432
00:25:25,788 --> 00:25:29,726
Yeah, with the lead actress on the bike,
singing a song...

433
00:25:30,205 --> 00:25:32,663
Hey,
where does the lead actress ride the bike?

434
00:25:32,746 --> 00:25:34,705
- It was Mr. Rajendra Prasad...
- Oh.

435
00:25:34,826 --> 00:25:36,810
- Oh, that guy.
- Why the hell am I telling you the story?

436
00:25:36,909 --> 00:25:38,105
- Because you're mad.
- Hey!

437
00:25:38,499 --> 00:25:39,291
So you've understood, right

438
00:25:39,330 --> 00:25:42,221
People in the village are scared when
Chiranjeevi enters on an Enfield bike...

439
00:25:42,343 --> 00:25:43,021
I didn't watch it...

440
00:25:43,077 --> 00:25:45,715
Everyone is scared when
he arrives on his Splendor

441
00:25:46,035 --> 00:25:48,086
I think I need to rewatch the film Hitler.

442
00:25:48,353 --> 00:25:50,728
Give me her phone number once.

443
00:25:50,871 --> 00:25:53,163
I'll make her fall for me in an hour.

444
00:25:53,288 --> 00:25:54,777
She doesn't use a mobile.

445
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:57,330
Good, then we can visit her at her house.

446
00:25:57,450 --> 00:25:58,742
Are you freaking nuts?

447
00:25:59,163 --> 00:26:01,177
I beg you, leave me!

448
00:26:01,728 --> 00:26:02,748
Damn!

449
00:26:03,538 --> 00:26:05,120
Hey, Robert...

450
00:26:05,496 --> 00:26:06,860
- Bottle...
- Snacks!

451
00:26:06,962 --> 00:26:09,455
- Hey Karuna... I'm coming home.
- Don't listen to him

452
00:26:09,621 --> 00:26:12,955
We must be at her house by dawn...

453
00:26:13,121 --> 00:26:15,746
And the girl must be
in our auto by dusk.

454
00:26:15,788 --> 00:26:17,705
- That's fixed.
- Okay, brother

455
00:26:18,163 --> 00:26:22,553
Light the firecrackers, man!
Everyone has to know about my love.

456
00:26:22,656 --> 00:26:27,300
[siren wailing]

457
00:26:28,038 --> 00:26:31,205
We'll be on duty in ten minutes.
Do you really need it now?

458
00:26:31,621 --> 00:26:35,205
"Need it?" On 5th August 2004...

459
00:26:35,621 --> 00:26:39,685
I begged our boss to get you this job.

460
00:26:39,996 --> 00:26:42,205
Do you think I needed to do that then?

461
00:26:42,496 --> 00:26:45,265
Who gave you the chance
to beg for a job for me?

462
00:26:45,357 --> 00:26:46,465
My daughter!

463
00:26:47,660 --> 00:26:49,718
I'm the one who begged
to get you this job...

464
00:26:49,955 --> 00:26:51,580
and you're saying it's
because of your daughter?

465
00:26:51,752 --> 00:26:54,743
Err... Alright, maybe.
Then let me drink to that!

466
00:26:57,121 --> 00:26:58,830
He's been working here for twenty years...

467
00:26:58,871 --> 00:27:01,854
why is he saying he got this
job because of his daughter?

468
00:27:01,914 --> 00:27:02,927
[scoffs]

469
00:27:03,121 --> 00:27:08,746
Ten years ago, he got a job in Nellore
with a monthly salary of ten thousand.

470
00:27:09,205 --> 00:27:12,429
The night before he was
meant to join that job...

471
00:27:12,996 --> 00:27:20,580
his daughter cried her
heart out, the whole night.

472
00:27:20,663 --> 00:27:22,955
- So sad
- Don't overthink about it

473
00:27:22,996 --> 00:27:25,867
She finally slept by dawn.

474
00:27:25,948 --> 00:27:27,222
- Oh.
- Yeah.

475
00:27:28,830 --> 00:27:34,080
The real shock was,
the news the next day.

476
00:27:34,288 --> 00:27:35,038
What happened?

477
00:27:35,205 --> 00:27:38,121
The train he was supposed
to catch that night derailed

478
00:27:38,413 --> 00:27:40,163
Many people died

479
00:27:40,236 --> 00:27:41,441
Oh no!

480
00:27:43,166 --> 00:27:44,326
From that day on, he believes...

481
00:27:44,496 --> 00:27:48,197
He believes that God came to him in the
form of his daughter and saved his life.

482
00:27:51,788 --> 00:27:54,413
He believes that God's
path is the right path.

483
00:27:58,120 --> 00:28:00,816
[church bell ringing]

484
00:28:00,905 --> 00:28:02,910
[humming]

485
00:28:06,845 --> 00:28:09,595
What's this, man?
We slept in the paddy fields...

486
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:11,804
and why we ended up in a street?

487
00:28:12,145 --> 00:28:13,297
Are you still hungover?

488
00:28:13,868 --> 00:28:16,106
You said, you'd reach Relangi
by dawn and woo the girl by dusk!

489
00:28:16,479 --> 00:28:18,265
That's her house,
Go, make her fall for you.

490
00:28:18,347 --> 00:28:19,374
Are we in Relangi?

491
00:28:19,604 --> 00:28:22,187
We blabber a lot when we're drunk...
do we really mean any of it?

492
00:28:22,297 --> 00:28:23,989
But you said you felt her touch, dude!

493
00:28:24,210 --> 00:28:30,169
Hey, when it comes to women
you know I change my mind instantly

494
00:28:30,437 --> 00:28:32,895
I was dazed until night
because she slapped me twice.

495
00:28:33,024 --> 00:28:35,252
And you took it seriously
and brought me to her village?

496
00:28:35,319 --> 00:28:36,325
Ah!

497
00:28:36,528 --> 00:28:38,541
I brought you here so you can
give me ideas to woo your "sister"

498
00:28:38,666 --> 00:28:40,516
Oh, so now she's my sister?

499
00:28:40,631 --> 00:28:42,532
Fine, then have her tie a rakhi on me too!

500
00:28:42,682 --> 00:28:45,365
There's still time for that...
come on, it's time.

501
00:28:45,479 --> 00:28:47,062
Hey, wait!

502
00:28:51,145 --> 00:28:54,172
Looks like Maya hasn't woken up yet.
Give me an idea to wake her up.

503
00:28:54,395 --> 00:28:56,770
- Old blankets for utensils!
- Get lost!

504
00:29:02,729 --> 00:29:04,854
He asks for help,
and when I do, he ignores.

505
00:29:05,328 --> 00:29:06,381
[Maya yawning]

506
00:29:10,315 --> 00:29:11,739
[vocalizing]

507
00:29:15,497 --> 00:29:16,377
[vocalizing]

508
00:29:16,479 --> 00:29:20,812
Bro, she looks awful in that outfit.
How can you be so crazy about her?

509
00:29:20,952 --> 00:29:21,940
[tuts]

510
00:29:22,020 --> 00:29:23,437
Look through my eyes, man...

511
00:29:23,645 --> 00:29:26,749
Doesn't she look like an
actress from romantic films?

512
00:29:27,727 --> 00:29:29,986
She doesn't look like Maya,
but like a maid

513
00:29:31,729 --> 00:29:32,895
Hey, where are you going?

514
00:29:35,312 --> 00:29:36,409
Hey, you!

515
00:29:38,965 --> 00:29:41,364
[Rahman panting]

516
00:29:42,058 --> 00:29:43,458
Get ready! It's time!

517
00:29:43,604 --> 00:29:46,687
Guess,
hitting people is her daily routine.

518
00:29:46,764 --> 00:29:48,234
- Let's go!
- Huh!

519
00:29:48,437 --> 00:29:50,140
Idiot, the chutney is all over me!

520
00:29:51,270 --> 00:29:52,895
I'm gonna be dead because of you.

521
00:29:55,145 --> 00:29:56,487
What? Want to go in?

522
00:29:57,496 --> 00:29:58,927
She's going to bathe

523
00:29:59,270 --> 00:30:01,023
They'll tie us to this tree and beat us.

524
00:30:01,395 --> 00:30:03,685
Idiot doesn't have any family values.

525
00:30:09,062 --> 00:30:11,152
Is that him? That Hitler Sam babu?

526
00:30:13,234 --> 00:30:14,320
Hmm!

527
00:30:14,550 --> 00:30:16,106
- Mm?
- Mm!

528
00:30:17,995 --> 00:30:19,464
Dad, your watch...

529
00:30:20,894 --> 00:30:21,907
Here.

530
00:30:31,354 --> 00:30:33,520
Hello madam! Clean properly!

531
00:30:33,751 --> 00:30:35,120
Going overboard!
[Maya screams]

532
00:30:35,666 --> 00:30:36,467
Dad!!

533
00:30:36,604 --> 00:30:38,374
Dad, Mum's beating me!

534
00:30:38,911 --> 00:30:40,534
Ah! Here he is again!

535
00:30:40,624 --> 00:30:42,492
- It's all his pampering...
- She hit me hard, Dad!

536
00:30:42,579 --> 00:30:44,729
Did she? Oh my little chick!

537
00:30:48,666 --> 00:30:50,683
Ah, you're here! Oh, it's scratching me!

538
00:30:52,863 --> 00:30:53,936
Look...

539
00:30:54,062 --> 00:30:55,645
I did what you asked for.

540
00:30:55,890 --> 00:30:57,223
Tea??
Yes

541
00:30:57,395 --> 00:30:59,433
We are out of Tea powder
Two minutes!

542
00:31:04,062 --> 00:31:05,786
Tea powder, please!
Not this, that one!

543
00:31:13,729 --> 00:31:14,798
Is the sugar sufficient?

544
00:31:15,044 --> 00:31:15,729
Super!

545
00:31:15,812 --> 00:31:18,909
What's with you,
why are you stuck to the tree?

546
00:31:20,395 --> 00:31:21,854
They're leaving, we should go too.

547
00:31:22,506 --> 00:31:23,506
Alright, come on!

548
00:31:23,575 --> 00:31:25,158
I didn't mean with them!

549
00:31:25,479 --> 00:31:27,770
'Loving children of The Lord...'

550
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:30,645
- Look at her!
- Stop your haste and sit here!

551
00:31:30,812 --> 00:31:32,424
Don't cry, go to sleep.

552
00:31:32,583 --> 00:31:33,520
'Ignoring the God's love...'

553
00:31:33,687 --> 00:31:35,437
'Roaming after boys
in the trance of love...'

554
00:31:35,530 --> 00:31:36,696
Why the hell are you guys here?

555
00:31:37,229 --> 00:31:40,479
'and girls running after
boys for sake of love'

556
00:31:40,645 --> 00:31:42,187
- Where to?
- I'm going for my peace!

557
00:31:42,270 --> 00:31:44,312
Is it a leg piece? Let me about it!

558
00:31:44,601 --> 00:31:47,601
[indistinct chatter]

559
00:31:47,729 --> 00:31:49,229
Praise the Lord!

560
00:31:51,391 --> 00:31:54,604
After seeing her...
and her world... up close today...

561
00:31:55,187 --> 00:31:57,437
She went even deeper into my heart.

562
00:31:57,780 --> 00:31:58,905
I've decided...

563
00:31:59,312 --> 00:32:01,562
Maya is my Satyabhama.

564
00:32:01,686 --> 00:32:02,865
Hey, you...

565
00:32:03,059 --> 00:32:04,937
- What's with him?
- He went deeper into love...

566
00:32:05,104 --> 00:32:07,020
and pushed me deep into
Relangi's pothole roads

567
00:32:07,161 --> 00:32:08,761
Hey, light a firecracker!

568
00:32:08,836 --> 00:32:11,135
- I've lost interest in life. Damn it!
- Alright, let me find a big one.

569
00:32:11,215 --> 00:32:14,547
Hope Sam Babu didn't see
you staring at Maya

570
00:32:16,187 --> 00:32:18,062
- How innocently you ask!
- Thank you...

571
00:32:18,187 --> 00:32:19,448
He was the one who spotted us first.

572
00:32:19,562 --> 00:32:20,960
He asked who we had come for.

573
00:32:21,020 --> 00:32:22,312
We said, Robert!

574
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:23,407
- Is it?
- Yeah.

575
00:32:23,486 --> 00:32:25,153
Hey, hey, he'll kill me!

576
00:32:25,229 --> 00:32:26,895
- Sam Babu won't let me live. Do something!
- Brother, brother...

577
00:32:26,979 --> 00:32:29,604
Let's do one thing.
I'll burst a cracker and you'll shoot up.

578
00:32:29,645 --> 00:32:31,104
Stop overacting!

579
00:32:31,437 --> 00:32:33,312
He looks innocent and calm.

580
00:32:33,437 --> 00:32:34,895
Like a walking good human being.

581
00:32:34,979 --> 00:32:37,937
We met him in the church,
he's fun with everyone.

582
00:32:38,145 --> 00:32:40,479
Yeah, you saw him in church
but not in community meetings

583
00:32:40,812 --> 00:32:43,789
Don't ruin his love
at the beginning itself.

584
00:32:44,312 --> 00:32:47,645
Let the girl accept his love first,
we'll convince her father later.

585
00:32:47,812 --> 00:32:50,832
Tell me frankly.
You're sure she'll reject him, right?

586
00:32:50,879 --> 00:32:51,917
Hey!

587
00:32:52,320 --> 00:32:53,493
What is he talking!

588
00:32:54,062 --> 00:32:55,487
She'll actually reject him.

589
00:32:56,854 --> 00:32:58,812
Fine, do whatever you want.

590
00:32:59,037 --> 00:33:01,887
Go to hell!
Anyway Sam Babu will surely kill me

591
00:33:02,062 --> 00:33:03,147
I'm on my way, Karuna

592
00:33:04,533 --> 00:33:05,979
[crowd cheering]

593
00:33:06,066 --> 00:33:09,390
Rahman gave away 20 runs in
the last over with his stupid bowling.

594
00:33:09,613 --> 00:33:12,532
We have to score 21,
And you couldn't score even 10!

595
00:33:13,044 --> 00:33:16,710
That betting money was from
my wife's monthly interest scheme!

596
00:33:16,870 --> 00:33:17,807
Play carefully.

597
00:33:17,937 --> 00:33:20,062
I'll silence the whole crowd...

598
00:33:23,258 --> 00:33:25,550
It's a six!

599
00:33:25,632 --> 00:33:26,549
Bro, can I light a cracker?

600
00:33:26,749 --> 00:33:28,791
This is college, they'll whack us,
keep them aside!

601
00:33:31,729 --> 00:33:33,145
It's a four!

602
00:33:37,562 --> 00:33:38,591
Your money is saved!

603
00:33:38,770 --> 00:33:40,770
One run out of 2 balls!
Our fellow will rock it.

604
00:33:46,558 --> 00:33:48,229
Hey you, Rahman!

605
00:33:48,581 --> 00:33:50,831
That's my wife's installment money, idiot!

606
00:33:54,649 --> 00:33:56,024
Say she's mine!

607
00:33:56,488 --> 00:33:58,837
Just make a run,
if you fail to hit

608
00:33:59,148 --> 00:34:01,307
Look at him, come on!

609
00:34:02,502 --> 00:34:04,648
- Just one run, please!
- Just one!

610
00:34:04,937 --> 00:34:06,312
Always ready for useless tantrums!

611
00:34:15,245 --> 00:34:17,864
It's all interest money, man!

612
00:34:17,878 --> 00:34:19,246
- He ruined it.
- Ball! Ball!

613
00:34:19,270 --> 00:34:21,770
Hey, come on!
Come on! It's one run

614
00:34:21,974 --> 00:34:25,937
- Run! Run!
- Make it! Come on!

615
00:34:26,229 --> 00:34:27,520
Keep the bat!

616
00:34:28,200 --> 00:34:29,323
How was that?

617
00:34:30,956 --> 00:34:32,986
Yay! We won the match!

618
00:34:33,271 --> 00:34:35,478
- I dropped the bat inside the line!
- Are you serious?

619
00:34:35,542 --> 00:34:37,165
They hit the wicket
after I crossed the crease.

620
00:34:37,229 --> 00:34:39,729
He's saying, he crossed
the line, it's not out.

621
00:34:39,937 --> 00:34:42,128
- He's saying, He crossed the line.
- What is it?

622
00:34:42,354 --> 00:34:44,312
Forget the line...

623
00:34:44,425 --> 00:34:47,133
He touched the wicket
with his hand, but not with the ball

624
00:34:47,229 --> 00:34:48,145
- Dont lie...
- I saw it too!

625
00:34:48,421 --> 00:34:49,720
Don't cheat, pay the bet.

626
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,787
Fatty failed to run and you blame me?

627
00:34:51,812 --> 00:34:53,937
- Who are you calling fatty?
- How dare you call me that?!

628
00:34:53,937 --> 00:34:57,656
[indistinct chatter]
You're the one who cheated!

629
00:34:57,789 --> 00:34:59,998
Why did you get out of the auto that day?

630
00:35:00,456 --> 00:35:02,748
- You were in my dreams all night that day.
- Me?

631
00:35:02,909 --> 00:35:03,484
Yeah!

632
00:35:04,126 --> 00:35:06,532
[distant crowd chatter]

633
00:35:06,893 --> 00:35:07,901
Maaya!

634
00:35:08,020 --> 00:35:10,379
That's my brother!
He's fighting with someone. Come on!

635
00:35:11,273 --> 00:35:12,899
This fat fellow
is beating me up!

636
00:35:15,387 --> 00:35:16,121
Hey, Brother!

637
00:35:16,328 --> 00:35:17,073
Hold on!

638
00:35:17,761 --> 00:35:20,164
[indistinct chatters]

639
00:35:21,417 --> 00:35:22,667
- Hey!
- Hey!

640
00:35:22,923 --> 00:35:23,716
Hey!

641
00:35:28,359 --> 00:35:29,143
Come on, guys!

642
00:35:29,278 --> 00:35:30,944
Do you have any sense?

643
00:35:33,039 --> 00:35:33,998
I'm sorry, Maaya.

644
00:35:34,501 --> 00:35:38,039
Hey, stop, guys! Why are you fighting
even after the match ended in a draw?

645
00:35:38,256 --> 00:35:41,282
Do you even
realize what you did?

646
00:35:43,164 --> 00:35:45,581
Dude, why did you slap
Sam Babu's daughter?

647
00:35:52,549 --> 00:35:54,049
I want to...

648
00:35:54,606 --> 00:35:55,739
You slapped her! Get lost!

649
00:35:58,539 --> 00:36:02,004
An integrating factor is a funtion
you multiply into a differential equation.

650
00:36:02,168 --> 00:36:04,141
- [distant firecrackers bursting]
- To transform it into a--

651
00:36:06,405 --> 00:36:07,272
Pay attention.

652
00:36:07,785 --> 00:36:08,972
FORGIVE ME!

653
00:36:13,236 --> 00:36:15,329
THIS WAS NOT MY IDEA!

654
00:36:19,227 --> 00:36:22,196
If you ask married men for
advice, you'll get outdated ideas.

655
00:36:22,456 --> 00:36:23,474
Look there!

656
00:36:25,649 --> 00:36:27,242
- To hell with you!
- Brother... brother.

657
00:36:41,913 --> 00:36:43,313
I'll be back in a minute, brother!

658
00:36:47,525 --> 00:36:49,109
- What have you done?
- I don't know.

659
00:36:53,289 --> 00:36:54,581
What's the spelling of "sorry"?

660
00:36:57,077 --> 00:36:57,956
Sorry, man.

661
00:37:02,672 --> 00:37:04,746
- If you're uneducated, what can I do?
- Hey, stop!

662
00:37:04,866 --> 00:37:06,583
If you give me one
more idea, I'll kill you.

663
00:37:07,248 --> 00:37:08,957
Hey, if you want to
beat me, then do it.

664
00:37:09,078 --> 00:37:11,206
- I can't run. I'm tired!
- Damn!

665
00:37:11,724 --> 00:37:12,371
<i>This will get me a lot of likes!</i>

666
00:37:12,473 --> 00:37:13,706
You don't even know the
spelling, and you're giving advice?

667
00:37:14,748 --> 00:37:15,956
Oh God!

668
00:37:16,456 --> 00:37:18,623
If I change one zero, the
whole spelling changes!

669
00:37:18,748 --> 00:37:19,973
That's not zero, it's O.

670
00:37:20,373 --> 00:37:23,510
Same thing! If you draw a zero,
can you even tell the difference?

671
00:37:24,627 --> 00:37:26,581
Hey! What rubbish
are you saying?

672
00:37:26,998 --> 00:37:29,199
"Sorry" is spelled S-O-R-R-Y.

673
00:37:29,444 --> 00:37:30,719
That sounds like "sorrii," doesn't it?

674
00:37:30,798 --> 00:37:32,256
- You!
- Do as you wish.

675
00:37:32,510 --> 00:37:33,704
If you already know it,
why are you asking me?

676
00:37:33,902 --> 00:37:34,642
Give it to me!

677
00:37:35,229 --> 00:37:35,895
Raju brother.

678
00:37:36,297 --> 00:37:38,422
To make a girl fall for
you, you need music.

679
00:37:38,707 --> 00:37:39,582
Naughty tunes?

680
00:37:39,739 --> 00:37:41,198
- Hey.
- Sorry!

681
00:37:41,592 --> 00:37:42,336
- Go on, Juvva.
- Brother!

682
00:37:42,531 --> 00:37:46,726
If you follow my idea, all
her anger will disappear.

683
00:37:46,839 --> 00:37:47,448
With whom?

684
00:37:48,573 --> 00:37:50,531
Hey, do as you wish.

685
00:37:50,781 --> 00:37:52,573
Believe his ideas if you want, okay?

686
00:37:52,790 --> 00:37:54,482
- Is it wrong to study well?
- Alright, keep going, brother.

687
00:37:55,114 --> 00:38:00,864
[Telugu song playing]

688
00:38:06,683 --> 00:38:08,201
If you keep doing this,
I'll take another auto.

689
00:38:08,373 --> 00:38:09,885
Oh no, sorry!

690
00:38:10,776 --> 00:38:11,560
Get in!

691
00:38:12,531 --> 00:38:14,712
Brother! Brother! Is everything fine?

692
00:38:14,893 --> 00:38:15,566
Crap!

693
00:38:16,258 --> 00:38:17,989
Looks like I'm done for today!

694
00:38:18,739 --> 00:38:19,823
Forget all this...

695
00:38:20,192 --> 00:38:22,776
I have an idea that'll make
you forgive me for sure!

696
00:38:23,608 --> 00:38:24,321
[sighs]

697
00:38:26,864 --> 00:38:28,303
Take this and forgive me.

698
00:38:28,598 --> 00:38:30,243
Do you think I'm a schoolgirl?

699
00:38:32,674 --> 00:38:34,546
[engine revving]

700
00:38:34,906 --> 00:38:35,614
What are you doing?

701
00:38:36,137 --> 00:38:37,470
Why are you driving so fast? Hey!

702
00:38:39,489 --> 00:38:41,989
Hey, there's a gate, Raju!

703
00:38:44,947 --> 00:38:46,261
Raju, please slow down!

704
00:38:48,372 --> 00:38:49,772
Listen to me, Raju.

705
00:38:54,923 --> 00:38:56,532
No one comes this way.

706
00:38:59,039 --> 00:39:01,527
No one will know if I do anything here.

707
00:39:11,042 --> 00:39:12,625
Hey, what are you doing, Raju?

708
00:39:29,129 --> 00:39:32,047
I've never raised my
hand on a girl in my life.

709
00:39:32,584 --> 00:39:35,580
And I slapped you by mistake.

710
00:39:35,820 --> 00:39:38,017
Please take these and forgive me.

711
00:39:38,387 --> 00:39:39,528
Forgive me, I said.

712
00:39:40,373 --> 00:39:42,697
I can't bear to see you angry.

713
00:39:45,706 --> 00:39:47,331
Thank God, you smiled.

714
00:39:48,248 --> 00:39:49,081
I'm not convinced yet.

715
00:39:52,734 --> 00:39:54,359
But I'm impressed...

716
00:39:58,801 --> 00:39:59,755
with this place!

717
00:40:40,930 --> 00:40:44,707
For the last prayer offering,
we bought bananas, right?

718
00:40:45,014 --> 00:40:46,722
We spent 830 rupees...

719
00:40:46,940 --> 00:40:48,648
but the shopkeeper
didn't give us a bill.

720
00:40:52,680 --> 00:40:54,722
- Don't forget the bill next time.
- Okay.

721
00:40:55,199 --> 00:40:57,699
Mr. Sam Babu, my daughter
is getting married this Friday.

722
00:40:58,136 --> 00:41:00,511
- You must come.
- What does the groom do?

723
00:41:00,956 --> 00:41:03,287
He works at the medical
shop in our center.

724
00:41:04,355 --> 00:41:07,772
So you worked there,
and now your son-in-law works there.

725
00:41:08,188 --> 00:41:09,850
So will their child work there too?

726
00:41:09,916 --> 00:41:11,207
They love each other.

727
00:41:11,836 --> 00:41:13,420
And he belongs to our caste too.

728
00:41:14,305 --> 00:41:15,430
They'll stay close to us.

729
00:41:16,180 --> 00:41:17,430
It's never about caste.

730
00:41:18,097 --> 00:41:19,889
If we marry her off to a
man with a poor income...

731
00:41:20,264 --> 00:41:21,639
our daughters will suffer in the future.

732
00:41:25,764 --> 00:41:26,639
Alright, I'll come for the wedding.

733
00:41:26,722 --> 00:41:27,764
- I'll get going.
- Hmm!

734
00:41:28,472 --> 00:41:29,222
Hi, Dad.

735
00:41:29,555 --> 00:41:31,862
- Hi, my little chick!
- Giving a lecture to David uncle?

736
00:41:31,998 --> 00:41:35,040
How can they marry off their
daughters to a man who barely earns?

737
00:41:36,430 --> 00:41:39,504
Anyway, Grandma called
and asked you to visit.

738
00:41:39,736 --> 00:41:42,368
Will you stay with her at the village
for a few days during the holidays?

739
00:41:42,555 --> 00:41:45,847
- I'll take her some <i>Putharekulu</i> this time.
- Okay.

740
00:41:46,441 --> 00:41:48,054
Looks like there's
a strike tomorrow.

741
00:41:48,466 --> 00:41:51,341
Don't go to college tomorrow,
just stay home and rest.

742
00:41:52,180 --> 00:41:52,930
How's it feeling now?

743
00:41:57,472 --> 00:42:00,764
Nothing to worry about, Dad.
It's just a small bruise. It'll fade.

744
00:42:13,097 --> 00:42:15,097
Seems many students are
taking the trains because of strike.

745
00:42:16,514 --> 00:42:17,680
There aren't many around here, right?

746
00:42:18,472 --> 00:42:20,055
Fine, you'll go safely, right?

747
00:42:20,555 --> 00:42:23,389
Don't overdo it like
you drop me every day.

748
00:42:23,993 --> 00:42:24,653
[sighs]

749
00:42:26,597 --> 00:42:28,097
It is crowded, right?

750
00:42:28,881 --> 00:42:31,385
And you're still a kid,
how will you manage?

751
00:42:32,055 --> 00:42:32,805
Let's do one thing.

752
00:42:33,472 --> 00:42:34,805
I'll drop you off safely today.

753
00:42:34,972 --> 00:42:36,389
Hey, where are you coming?

754
00:42:38,882 --> 00:42:40,549
As your brother, I have
my responsibilities too.

755
00:42:41,196 --> 00:42:43,237
Brother? Responsibilities?

756
00:42:49,389 --> 00:42:50,972
Hey, who are you looking for?

757
00:42:51,180 --> 00:42:53,055
Looking after passengers
is part of my routine.

758
00:42:53,597 --> 00:42:54,746
It's become a habit now.

759
00:42:56,709 --> 00:42:59,096
[train honking]

760
00:43:01,014 --> 00:43:01,680
You're right though!

761
00:43:02,097 --> 00:43:03,889
As you said, there's not much crowd.

762
00:43:04,389 --> 00:43:05,680
You go, I'll head off from here.

763
00:43:24,952 --> 00:43:27,244
She's in already.
Leave her hand now.

764
00:43:33,180 --> 00:43:34,764
- Hi, Maaya.
- Why didn't you come yesterday?

765
00:43:34,972 --> 00:43:36,097
I caught a cold.

766
00:43:38,889 --> 00:43:41,484
- One... two... three...
- What? Didn't you say you were leaving?

767
00:43:41,746 --> 00:43:45,329
Actually... the train started moving,
right? I'll get down at the next station.

768
00:43:46,033 --> 00:43:47,674
You know him, right?
He's my brother

769
00:43:48,825 --> 00:43:52,123
- How could I forget him?
- Hey, say sorry to her.

770
00:43:52,493 --> 00:43:55,110
She's been acting strange
ever since you slapped her

771
00:43:55,533 --> 00:43:56,908
Is everything alright?

772
00:43:58,117 --> 00:43:58,992
Sorry, ma'am

773
00:44:01,908 --> 00:44:03,158
Forgive him this once

774
00:44:03,408 --> 00:44:05,075
You're backing him because
he's your brother, aren't you?

775
00:44:05,117 --> 00:44:06,700
Fine, tell me what you want me to do?

776
00:44:07,992 --> 00:44:10,408
Setting off fireworks and
writing "sorry" on a plate

777
00:44:10,450 --> 00:44:11,700
Or playing, I'm Very Sorry
from Telugu film Nuvve Nuvve?

778
00:44:11,742 --> 00:44:13,533
Giving chocolates or
diving into the river...

779
00:44:15,283 --> 00:44:16,658
Shall I get some flowers or what?

780
00:44:18,867 --> 00:44:20,825
Why he's blabbering about flowers?

781
00:44:21,992 --> 00:44:24,117
No need for all that,
sorry is enough!

782
00:44:30,325 --> 00:44:31,908
Attili stop is here, get down

783
00:44:32,075 --> 00:44:33,158
We'll go

784
00:44:33,367 --> 00:44:34,783
- Brother-in-law?
- Lakshmi?

785
00:44:35,158 --> 00:44:36,075
How are you?

786
00:44:36,242 --> 00:44:38,658
What are you doing on this train?
Oh, you got in because of the strike?

787
00:44:38,825 --> 00:44:41,075
You don't study anyway, right...
Then where are you going in this train?

788
00:44:41,242 --> 00:44:42,617
Hop onto train first...

789
00:44:42,742 --> 00:44:45,158
we'll talk later. -We're matching
today like planned outfits, beau!

790
00:44:45,450 --> 00:44:47,575
Oh, were you dropping your sister off?

791
00:44:47,783 --> 00:44:48,575
How are you, Samaikya?

792
00:44:48,700 --> 00:44:49,117
Careful

793
00:44:50,742 --> 00:44:52,825
Sorry, beau,
Don't take it wrong

794
00:44:53,367 --> 00:44:55,492
She's my uncle's daughter, Lakshmi

795
00:44:55,992 --> 00:44:57,658
Maaya, she's my close friend

796
00:44:57,950 --> 00:45:00,283
If she's your close friend,
she's my friend too

797
00:45:00,450 --> 00:45:01,658
Nice to meet you

798
00:45:01,825 --> 00:45:03,283
My full name is Kanaka Mahalakshmi

799
00:45:03,408 --> 00:45:05,158
You can call me Mahalakshmi

800
00:45:05,408 --> 00:45:09,367
My beau lovingly calls me Lakshmi

801
00:45:09,783 --> 00:45:11,367
Oh my, I forgot to ask...

802
00:45:11,533 --> 00:45:12,908
[yapping continues]

803
00:45:12,950 --> 00:45:14,533
[yapping continues]

804
00:45:14,617 --> 00:45:16,867
[yapping continues]

805
00:45:16,950 --> 00:45:18,242
[yapping continues]

806
00:45:18,325 --> 00:45:19,325
what's yours?

807
00:45:19,742 --> 00:45:22,200
Please stop, you're talking
faster than the train

808
00:45:22,325 --> 00:45:24,283
Look, Bhimavaram station is here, come on!

809
00:45:24,408 --> 00:45:26,867
I lose track of time when I talk to you

810
00:45:26,992 --> 00:45:29,325
Your cheeks are so soft
Bye!

811
00:45:29,658 --> 00:45:30,450
Bye, Samaikya

812
00:45:31,158 --> 00:45:33,325
Bye, beau
Take care!

813
00:45:34,533 --> 00:45:36,658
Hey Reenu, wait, I'm coming!

814
00:45:37,658 --> 00:45:39,825
You came here for sake of your
sister-in-law, and boasting as duties!

815
00:45:40,075 --> 00:45:40,408
Come on

816
00:45:49,117 --> 00:45:50,033
There's a strike today...

817
00:45:50,742 --> 00:45:52,283
most people won't come
to college anyway

818
00:45:52,742 --> 00:45:54,325
Varsham got re-released,
shall we go to the movie?

819
00:45:54,617 --> 00:45:56,283
- What, they re-released Varsham?
- Yeah.

820
00:45:57,117 --> 00:45:59,700
We can go
But Maaya doesn't watch films

821
00:45:59,825 --> 00:46:00,825
What's wrong with you?

822
00:46:00,867 --> 00:46:02,825
It's a Prabhas film,
and it's Varsham (rain)

823
00:46:02,950 --> 00:46:03,950
you've got to get drenched!

824
00:46:04,849 --> 00:46:07,576
I mean, you've got to watch it

825
00:46:07,899 --> 00:46:08,908
I don't like movies

826
00:46:09,225 --> 00:46:11,985
You'll know once you've
actually seen it, won't you?

827
00:46:16,910 --> 00:46:17,933
Oh my!

828
00:46:18,433 --> 00:46:20,100
You're going overboard now!

829
00:46:20,159 --> 00:46:21,742
It's a dialogue from
a film called Manmadhudu!

830
00:46:22,142 --> 00:46:23,433
Come only if you like it.

831
00:46:23,725 --> 00:46:25,600
It's a Prabhas film,
and it's Varsham...

832
00:46:26,142 --> 00:46:27,258
It'd be great if you came

833
00:46:28,308 --> 00:46:29,725
But trust me on this...

834
00:46:29,892 --> 00:46:32,600
if you feel that vibe once,

835
00:46:33,267 --> 00:46:36,392
you'll never forget it.

836
00:46:50,392 --> 00:46:51,767
Why did he shifted the seats?

837
00:46:54,267 --> 00:46:55,308
[cheering in theatre]

838
00:47:00,225 --> 00:47:01,017
Come on...

839
00:47:01,183 --> 00:47:03,558
throw the confetti!
Go on!

840
00:47:09,308 --> 00:47:10,975
Hail Prabhas!

841
00:47:12,058 --> 00:47:14,350
[movie playing]

842
00:47:19,725 --> 00:47:22,267
Why are you acting overly
infront of your sister in train?

843
00:47:22,392 --> 00:47:23,725
Even you're playing along right!

844
00:47:29,808 --> 00:47:30,850
What's wrong with her?

845
00:47:31,683 --> 00:47:32,142
Have it.

846
00:47:33,225 --> 00:47:34,142
Yeah, I mean, one for each

847
00:47:34,683 --> 00:47:36,267
Dude, I just got relieved from cold

848
00:47:36,433 --> 00:47:37,142
Eat it anyway

849
00:47:39,683 --> 00:47:43,683
[music]

850
00:47:48,808 --> 00:47:54,683
<i>O Golden doll, </i>
<i>My lovely maiden,</i>

851
00:47:55,808 --> 00:47:57,558
You forced me to eat the ice cream

852
00:47:57,808 --> 00:47:59,142
You're laughing!
Say sorry!

853
00:47:59,850 --> 00:48:00,933
Fine, sorry!
Go now!

854
00:48:06,558 --> 00:48:09,433
They're saying tomorrow is also a strike

855
00:48:11,350 --> 00:48:12,642
What have you planned for tomorrow?

856
00:48:13,808 --> 00:48:21,808
<i>My heart leaps to hear you,</i>

857
00:48:22,142 --> 00:48:30,017
<i>My soul soars at the </i>
<i>sound of your voice,</i>

858
00:48:31,350 --> 00:48:33,642
<i>The dreams which are... </i>

859
00:48:33,808 --> 00:48:35,725
- Where's your sister?
- She's feeling cold

860
00:48:38,850 --> 00:48:46,183
<i>O Golden doll,</i>
<i>My lovely maiden,</i>

861
00:49:07,642 --> 00:49:08,558
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

862
00:49:22,517 --> 00:49:24,683
Your sister-in-law looks nice,
why don't you just marry her?

863
00:49:25,017 --> 00:49:26,475
I agree with you

864
00:49:30,933 --> 00:49:32,433
Why do you care?

865
00:49:33,058 --> 00:49:33,850
Just asking casually...

866
00:49:33,933 --> 00:49:35,808
Please, tell me...

867
00:49:40,808 --> 00:49:41,558
Pack these

868
00:49:45,558 --> 00:49:53,892
<i>With you beside me, </i>
<i>no path feels barred,</i>

869
00:49:59,183 --> 00:50:00,142
Is PhonePe available, kid?

870
00:50:02,683 --> 00:50:04,100
Did you kept this note
as a remembrance of mine?

871
00:50:08,475 --> 00:50:10,558
Don't live in dreams,
I'm here with you

872
00:50:10,850 --> 00:50:12,725
Why do you need it?
Idiot.

873
00:50:13,308 --> 00:50:14,017
Is your dad strict?

874
00:50:14,517 --> 00:50:15,350
Why are you asking that?

875
00:50:15,850 --> 00:50:17,058
Because you don't use a phone

876
00:50:17,350 --> 00:50:18,475
I thought your parents must be strict

877
00:50:18,808 --> 00:50:20,600
There's no link between
my dad and me using phone

878
00:50:20,892 --> 00:50:22,350
He gives me whatever I ask for

879
00:50:22,933 --> 00:50:23,475
He's my favourite

880
00:50:24,433 --> 00:50:25,058
I just don't like phones

881
00:50:27,433 --> 00:50:33,225
<i>O Golden doll,</i>
<i>My beautiful damsel,</i>

882
00:50:33,517 --> 00:50:34,683
You've been with me all morning

883
00:50:34,808 --> 00:50:35,725
when did you buy this?

884
00:50:36,225 --> 00:50:38,475
Maaya works magic

885
00:50:39,975 --> 00:50:41,100
You really did magic

886
00:50:45,892 --> 00:50:46,933
What do you like in me?

887
00:50:53,433 --> 00:50:54,558
You should've also opt for studying, right

888
00:50:55,350 --> 00:50:56,308
Why aren't you going?

889
00:50:56,725 --> 00:50:58,100
If one person in the
family wants to study...

890
00:50:58,433 --> 00:51:01,058
the whole family has to struggle with them

891
00:51:01,600 --> 00:51:05,183
And they need real passion to study

892
00:51:06,225 --> 00:51:07,933
which I don't have

893
00:51:08,017 --> 00:51:09,975
So‚

894
00:51:13,683 --> 00:51:14,736
If we had phones...

895
00:51:14,850 --> 00:51:17,392
we wouldn't get to spend time like this

896
00:51:18,972 --> 00:51:20,267
You always put things nicely

897
00:51:21,558 --> 00:51:25,183
I've got a long list of reasons
for what I like about you

898
00:51:26,892 --> 00:51:30,100
- A long list?
- Shut up and get into the train

899
00:51:30,725 --> 00:51:32,183
Tell me just one

900
00:51:32,392 --> 00:51:32,975
Please

901
00:51:33,350 --> 00:51:34,517
One tight slap,
that's what you'll get.

902
00:51:37,517 --> 00:51:41,517
[vocalizing]

903
00:51:51,267 --> 00:51:52,975
Why are you so late, dear?

904
00:51:55,683 --> 00:51:57,767
I lost track of time while
shopping in Bhimavaram

905
00:51:57,808 --> 00:51:59,392
I missed the five o'clock train

906
00:51:59,475 --> 00:52:00,808
So, came on the seven o'clock, isn't it?

907
00:52:01,642 --> 00:52:02,642
- You're too clever, Dad
- Isn't it?

908
00:52:03,850 --> 00:52:05,558
Oh God, it's eight o'clock

909
00:52:05,892 --> 00:52:07,100
You didn't go to work?

910
00:52:07,183 --> 00:52:08,725
I'm waiting for you, little girl

911
00:52:09,100 --> 00:52:10,267
Go and eat

912
00:52:11,517 --> 00:52:12,142
Sorry, dear

913
00:52:12,558 --> 00:52:13,267
First time...

914
00:52:13,725 --> 00:52:14,808
It's alright, Dad

915
00:52:15,142 --> 00:52:16,267
Go have your dinner, then sleep

916
00:52:16,392 --> 00:52:17,725
I'm not hungry, Dad

917
00:52:17,933 --> 00:52:19,692
I had loads while shopping.

918
00:52:20,350 --> 00:52:22,392
You ate bajjis, punugulu and all?

919
00:52:22,517 --> 00:52:24,892
- You really know me, Dad
- Because, you're my daughter, dear

920
00:52:25,350 --> 00:52:28,600
Look how angrily Mum's
staring at me, Dad

921
00:52:29,517 --> 00:52:32,350
Hey, what now she won't eat for today

922
00:52:32,392 --> 00:52:33,500
she'll just drink buttermilk
and go to bed

923
00:52:33,642 --> 00:52:34,850
You go, dear

924
00:52:35,683 --> 00:52:38,933
- My loving Dad.
- Go to sleep, love.

925
00:52:49,767 --> 00:52:51,683
She is coming home late these days.

926
00:52:53,100 --> 00:52:54,392
She is hardly eating at home.

927
00:52:56,808 --> 00:52:57,892
What's going on?

928
00:53:09,892 --> 00:53:13,183
If the laddle falls,
only we will know about it

929
00:53:14,225 --> 00:53:15,725
but if our daughter crosses a line...

930
00:53:16,767 --> 00:53:18,308
whole village will get to know!

931
00:53:19,483 --> 00:53:21,441
I don't want my daughter
to bear the wrong mark!

932
00:53:23,683 --> 00:53:24,879
Don't let it happen!

933
00:53:26,853 --> 00:53:28,519
[humming]

934
00:53:29,786 --> 00:53:32,133
Could you drop me at Manchili Center?

935
00:53:32,220 --> 00:53:34,587
Err... I'm not gonna take that route

936
00:53:35,069 --> 00:53:36,857
Brother...
That driver will take you!

937
00:53:57,819 --> 00:53:58,236
Hey...

938
00:54:00,528 --> 00:54:01,319
Hop in, ma'am

939
00:54:01,736 --> 00:54:02,878
Yeah, yeah... Hop in.

940
00:54:06,069 --> 00:54:07,819
Is your sister still down with a cold?

941
00:54:10,563 --> 00:54:11,303
Raju...

942
00:54:11,981 --> 00:54:12,943
No, yes...

943
00:54:13,041 --> 00:54:14,416
Yeah, she's fine

944
00:54:24,569 --> 00:54:26,486
Hey, do you know Gelon Musk?

945
00:54:26,724 --> 00:54:29,116
You mean that girl who sells
masks at the end of our street?

946
00:54:29,403 --> 00:54:31,444
- Yeah, I know her
- Yeah, obviously how will you know!

947
00:54:33,182 --> 00:54:33,802
Hey, hey...

948
00:54:33,944 --> 00:54:35,528
Sorry, man, don't take it the wrong way

949
00:54:35,903 --> 00:54:37,028
No, you idiot

950
00:54:38,236 --> 00:54:40,819
No bro, he fooled you this time

951
00:54:47,236 --> 00:54:48,028
Have anything to say?

952
00:54:49,361 --> 00:54:50,986
You look beautiful today

953
00:54:51,069 --> 00:54:52,069
So every other day I look average, is it?

954
00:54:52,903 --> 00:54:54,111
Ofcourse, you look beautiful all the time!

955
00:54:54,194 --> 00:54:56,028
You look extra special today

956
00:54:57,736 --> 00:54:58,986
Which film dialogue is that from?

957
00:54:59,069 --> 00:55:01,736
Oh my God,
this is my real feeling!

958
00:55:02,278 --> 00:55:05,069
Well, maybe it exists in some film too

959
00:55:05,209 --> 00:55:06,684
But you really do look beautiful today

960
00:55:07,711 --> 00:55:09,127
What, am I really more
beautiful than your sister-in-law?

961
00:55:09,736 --> 00:55:13,319
Compared to Lakshmi, you...

962
00:55:13,903 --> 00:55:16,819
Am I not allowed to look
special on my birthday?

963
00:55:20,111 --> 00:55:22,611
Wait, hold on, birthday?

964
00:55:27,194 --> 00:55:29,111
Don't go to class yet,
give me two minutes

965
00:55:29,486 --> 00:55:30,236
I'll be back

966
00:55:45,736 --> 00:55:46,694
Happy birthday

967
00:55:47,028 --> 00:55:48,361
What, bindis?

968
00:55:48,611 --> 00:55:51,278
You look even prettier with a bindi

969
00:55:51,986 --> 00:55:52,944
Come on, just try it once

970
00:55:53,444 --> 00:55:55,153
We have to save you,
you'll look ravishing

971
00:55:56,694 --> 00:55:58,569
There's an annual day
function in my college.

972
00:55:58,944 --> 00:55:59,361
Come there.

973
00:55:59,780 --> 00:56:02,536
How on earth can I come
to your college function?

974
00:56:02,828 --> 00:56:05,788
The same way you play
cricket with my college students.

975
00:56:07,911 --> 00:56:10,101
I'll come.
Surely, I'll come!

976
00:56:19,695 --> 00:56:21,289
You should've given her
a lipstick too, right!

977
00:56:23,608 --> 00:56:25,046
Dude... Sorry, dude.

978
00:56:25,246 --> 00:56:26,590
It's Maaya's birthday.

979
00:56:27,347 --> 00:56:29,075
Don't cover your
mistakes by saying sorry to me.

980
00:56:29,294 --> 00:56:30,965
This is the first time I paid a
fare for traveling in an auto.

981
00:56:31,221 --> 00:56:32,733
- I paid it, brother.
- Shut up!

982
00:56:32,986 --> 00:56:34,300
Even Robert ditched me.

983
00:56:34,544 --> 00:56:36,121
I've got two auto drivers
as pals, what's the use?

984
00:56:36,982 --> 00:56:39,380
Dude, don't feel
bad... and don't get angry!

985
00:56:39,778 --> 00:56:41,778
I'll give you a
proper treat this evening.

986
00:56:42,766 --> 00:56:44,300
Hey, keep those in the canteen and come.

987
00:56:44,544 --> 00:56:46,874
- Come on...
- Bro, how can I carry these by myself?

988
00:56:47,074 --> 00:56:47,574
Brother!

989
00:56:47,774 --> 00:56:51,869
[song playing]

990
00:56:55,503 --> 00:56:57,278
People are dancing like drunk monkeys!

991
00:56:57,503 --> 00:56:58,753
You said party and got me here.

992
00:57:01,419 --> 00:57:02,798
Hey, that auto girl...

993
00:57:04,461 --> 00:57:05,823
Hey, who's that?

994
00:57:06,023 --> 00:57:07,169
How dare he to lay hand on my girl?

995
00:57:09,152 --> 00:57:10,876
- Don't watch...
- Okay, brother!

996
00:57:11,076 --> 00:57:13,230
[sings Nuvvosthanante
song from the film Varsham]

997
00:57:13,430 --> 00:57:17,211
Maaya from 3rd year ECE,
is going to perform to this song.

998
00:57:17,411 --> 00:57:19,071
- Let us all welcome her!
- Woah! Brother...

999
00:57:20,601 --> 00:57:22,915
Hey, the attitude girl has
come to perform her dance.

1000
00:57:25,177 --> 00:57:27,145
Dude, she's wearing the bindi I gave her.

1001
00:57:27,919 --> 00:57:30,167
Gosh, look at his hype
for his mere bindi sticker!

1002
00:57:35,866 --> 00:57:42,188
[Nuvvasthanante song
playing from the film Varsham]

1003
00:57:42,388 --> 00:57:43,471
Look at her, dude!

1004
00:57:43,671 --> 00:57:46,838
[crowd cheering]

1005
00:57:47,544 --> 00:57:49,178
Hey, it's getting late.

1006
00:58:14,339 --> 00:58:16,156
We thought she couldn't dance well,
but she did very well.

1007
00:58:16,356 --> 00:58:17,140
Yes, man.

1008
00:58:17,948 --> 00:58:20,537
[crowd cheering]
Maaya, superb!

1009
00:58:21,275 --> 00:58:23,606
If he sees a girl, he will go behind her.

1010
00:58:23,806 --> 00:58:25,896
Huh! Yeah, look who's saying that!

1011
00:58:35,128 --> 00:58:35,878
How did I perform?

1012
00:58:36,961 --> 00:58:38,623
- You have this side of you, too?
- What?

1013
00:58:39,503 --> 00:58:42,454
Heavens!
You literally matched Trisha!

1014
00:58:45,669 --> 00:58:48,756
Thanks, Raju. This is the
first time I danced on stage.

1015
00:58:49,003 --> 00:58:50,449
I was scared whether
you'd like it or not.

1016
00:58:51,836 --> 00:58:53,119
You look so beautiful, Maaya.

1017
00:58:59,878 --> 00:59:01,023
Congratulations, Maaya...

1018
00:59:01,223 --> 00:59:02,295
- You smashed it.
- Thank you.

1019
00:59:02,495 --> 00:59:03,495
- Come, let's go.
- Come on!

1020
00:59:04,769 --> 00:59:06,731
I'll just pack my things and come,
we'll leave.

1021
00:59:15,851 --> 00:59:16,972
- Raju...
- Hmm?

1022
00:59:17,266 --> 00:59:19,256
recently you took me through
that paddy-fields road, right?

1023
00:59:20,419 --> 00:59:21,514
Take me on that same road again.

1024
00:59:23,023 --> 00:59:25,384
- Now? At this time?
- Please, Raju...

1025
00:59:25,586 --> 00:59:27,586
Let's go once and then
we'll go back home.

1026
00:59:35,720 --> 00:59:40,208
[thunders rumbling]

1027
01:00:34,368 --> 01:00:39,272
[music]

1028
01:00:58,580 --> 01:01:02,093
Raju, this place looks even more
beautiful at night than in the day.

1029
01:01:06,636 --> 01:01:08,704
Why are you staring at me?
Go...

1030
01:01:09,153 --> 01:01:10,153
Get me the lotus!

1031
01:01:32,579 --> 01:01:35,530
[thunder rumbles]

1032
01:01:48,386 --> 01:01:49,438
Come inside.

1033
01:01:58,303 --> 01:02:00,066
How did you know that
today is my birthday?

1034
01:02:02,803 --> 01:02:07,432
I felt so happy knowing that your
birthday comes right after mine, Raju.

1035
01:02:15,844 --> 01:02:17,894
I didn't liked it yesterday, but...

1036
01:02:18,136 --> 01:02:19,568
this looks so good now.

1037
01:02:19,768 --> 01:02:23,291
That's why you should never
underestimate a girl's choice.

1038
01:02:24,261 --> 01:02:25,668
Hey, it's 12 o'clock.

1039
01:02:26,042 --> 01:02:27,047
Happy birthday, Raju.

1040
01:02:27,452 --> 01:02:30,331
Cut the cake.
Don't blow the candle, please.

1041
01:03:05,410 --> 01:03:08,697
[thunders rumbling]
[gasps]

1042
01:03:47,357 --> 01:03:48,617
[thunder rumbles]

1043
01:03:51,428 --> 01:03:53,919
- Hey, shall we try this?
- Okay.

1044
01:04:06,261 --> 01:04:07,261
Bye!

1045
01:04:17,378 --> 01:04:20,486
- Sorry, Maaya, It's just a watch...
- Let's go from here.

1046
01:04:31,246 --> 01:04:32,319
Keep going!

1047
01:04:34,279 --> 01:04:36,114
Brother, take her safely. OK?

1048
01:04:36,568 --> 01:04:37,761
[thunder rumbles]

1049
01:04:38,395 --> 01:04:39,654
What is it, Mr. Sam Babu?

1050
01:04:40,211 --> 01:04:43,900
The weather is cool, but,
you're sweating so much?

1051
01:04:46,387 --> 01:04:49,209
Maaya hasn't been coming
home on time these days.

1052
01:04:49,463 --> 01:04:51,023
She's not even eating properly.

1053
01:04:51,143 --> 01:04:52,381
I'm worried.

1054
01:04:52,484 --> 01:04:55,118
Oh! She's a college student...

1055
01:04:55,234 --> 01:04:57,232
Why are you worrying for that?

1056
01:04:57,644 --> 01:04:59,598
- Do you think she is still a kid?
- Hey... hey... hey!

1057
01:04:59,881 --> 01:05:00,752
- Huh?
- Sam Babu...

1058
01:05:00,876 --> 01:05:03,347
Can't you see the board
saying "Don't urinate on the wall"?

1059
01:05:03,978 --> 01:05:05,603
Stand like a security
guard, and do your job!

1060
01:05:06,644 --> 01:05:08,812
How dare you talk
about my job like that?

1061
01:05:09,012 --> 01:05:10,675
Hey, Sam Babu... Let him go.

1062
01:05:10,875 --> 01:05:16,186
[indistinct chatters]

1063
01:05:16,563 --> 01:05:19,148
- Get lost!
- Why he's teaching about my job?

1064
01:05:20,819 --> 01:05:21,844
What happened?

1065
01:05:30,228 --> 01:05:31,333
What happened?

1066
01:05:37,061 --> 01:05:38,816
As your holidays start tomorrow...

1067
01:05:39,519 --> 01:05:41,987
When will we meet again?
[thunder rumbles]

1068
01:05:43,019 --> 01:05:46,003
- Maaya?
- Huh?

1069
01:05:49,186 --> 01:05:50,105
Maaya, wait!

1070
01:05:50,305 --> 01:05:51,508
Don't go like that, Maaya...

1071
01:05:51,708 --> 01:05:54,046
- Maaya, please I did it unintentionally.
- Leave me!

1072
01:05:54,269 --> 01:05:55,269
- Listen to me...
- What are you doing?

1073
01:05:56,644 --> 01:05:57,891
Can't you understand
when I say "leave me"?

1074
01:06:00,769 --> 01:06:01,972
You're joking, right?

1075
01:06:13,770 --> 01:06:14,915
[thunder rumbles]

1076
01:06:17,382 --> 01:06:18,901
Don't you dare meet me again.

1077
01:06:46,080 --> 01:06:47,699
[birds chirping]

1078
01:06:49,009 --> 01:06:50,757
No, dear.

1079
01:06:50,957 --> 01:06:53,115
I already told you.

1080
01:06:53,961 --> 01:06:56,373
- Oh Lord... Damn! Sleep properly.
- Sorry, Babu.

1081
01:06:56,573 --> 01:06:57,809
Damn you!

1082
01:07:07,951 --> 01:07:08,951
Hey, hey...

1083
01:07:09,151 --> 01:07:10,124
Hey, hey! Get up, boys!

1084
01:07:10,324 --> 01:07:12,595
What's with you, ruining our sleep?

1085
01:07:12,795 --> 01:07:14,642
The cake we bought for Raju's birthday,

1086
01:07:14,842 --> 01:07:17,030
we ate that as a snack
with our booze, dude!

1087
01:07:17,493 --> 01:07:20,983
Hey, you said you'd call him
last night. What happened?

1088
01:07:21,875 --> 01:07:22,870
Last night?

1089
01:07:23,070 --> 01:07:26,057
Raju, our boys are
waiting for you at our spot.

1090
01:07:27,284 --> 01:07:28,573
Why's the voice so nice?

1091
01:07:28,784 --> 01:07:29,784
- Hey...
- Huh?

1092
01:07:30,159 --> 01:07:34,414
I misdialed to Raji from
Razole instead of Raju last night.

1093
01:07:34,614 --> 01:07:36,456
Hey, Rajeswari!

1094
01:07:36,857 --> 01:07:39,051
You remember me after so long?
[cracker bursts]

1095
01:07:39,743 --> 01:07:42,237
You turn into a dog the
moment you hear a girls voice.

1096
01:07:42,437 --> 01:07:43,437
Hold up, boys.

1097
01:07:47,187 --> 01:07:48,292
Happy birthday, man.

1098
01:07:49,465 --> 01:07:50,655
There's nothing happy.

1099
01:07:50,855 --> 01:07:53,399
- I've lost it, man.
- What happened?

1100
01:07:55,659 --> 01:07:58,331
When I was dropping Maaya
back home after the function...

1101
01:07:59,618 --> 01:08:01,857
Due to an unexpected situation
we went in a different route,

1102
01:08:02,743 --> 01:08:04,028
a small mistake happened, man!

1103
01:08:04,228 --> 01:08:06,057
- A mistake?
- Already?

1104
01:08:07,868 --> 01:08:10,991
God... a firecracker went into
the President's house, bro.

1105
01:08:11,201 --> 01:08:12,813
- Hey! Go to sleep!
- Brother...

1106
01:08:13,451 --> 01:08:15,224
Raju brother, when did you come?

1107
01:08:15,424 --> 01:08:16,848
Wait, I'll burst a cracker.

1108
01:08:18,626 --> 01:08:20,072
Happy birthday, brother!
[cracker bursts]

1109
01:08:21,657 --> 01:08:22,789
Tell us what happened.

1110
01:08:22,989 --> 01:08:25,010
Well, since it was my birthday...

1111
01:08:25,826 --> 01:08:29,167
Maaya surprised me at
12 o'clock in the auto.

1112
01:08:30,618 --> 01:08:31,874
And then...

1113
01:08:32,451 --> 01:08:33,980
What happened next?

1114
01:08:34,618 --> 01:08:35,941
She kissed me, man.

1115
01:08:37,408 --> 01:08:42,500
So you "did it" in the
auto last night, isn't it?

1116
01:08:45,409 --> 01:08:48,624
Look at our Juvva's underwear,
he's arranged it like a wedding display.

1117
01:08:49,576 --> 01:08:51,654
Do you need all that now?

1118
01:08:52,618 --> 01:08:54,276
I don't know what came over her...

1119
01:08:54,701 --> 01:08:56,991
When I dropped her home, she slapped me.

1120
01:08:57,284 --> 01:08:58,593
That's women for you.

1121
01:08:58,793 --> 01:09:01,392
Their minds change like
power supply, on and off.

1122
01:09:01,600 --> 01:09:03,142
It's their nature. What can we do?

1123
01:09:03,576 --> 01:09:05,976
Even a married woman wouldn't marry him.

1124
01:09:06,951 --> 01:09:09,799
Listen to me, and talk to her.

1125
01:09:09,999 --> 01:09:12,918
Find out what her problem is.
Then find a solution.

1126
01:09:13,201 --> 01:09:15,051
Hey! I knew it...

1127
01:09:15,251 --> 01:09:18,038
You all will make me the scapegoat.

1128
01:09:18,238 --> 01:09:19,655
I'm not coming to Relangi.

1129
01:09:19,855 --> 01:09:21,465
Thank God, come on let's escape!

1130
01:09:21,665 --> 01:09:22,963
Juvva, wait, we are also coming.

1131
01:09:23,163 --> 01:09:25,635
If Sam Babu finds out about the
kissing scene, he'll chop us into pieces.

1132
01:09:25,835 --> 01:09:26,421
You walk carefully.

1133
01:09:27,251 --> 01:09:29,663
- Hey, this isn't time for celebrations!
- Useless fellows!

1134
01:09:29,863 --> 01:09:31,194
- Do you know what he did?
- What happened, brother?

1135
01:09:31,394 --> 01:09:34,223
- He kissed!
- Oh my, he kissed? Did he?

1136
01:09:37,957 --> 01:09:42,101
[random song playing over a radio]

1137
01:09:45,513 --> 01:09:48,284
He is playing that song just
to finish his toilet business.

1138
01:09:48,484 --> 01:09:50,928
It's disgusting when you
connect everything to everything.

1139
01:10:04,118 --> 01:10:05,462
Dude, Maaya's scarf...

1140
01:10:07,618 --> 01:10:09,881
Heavens sake, it's curtain, man!

1141
01:10:10,167 --> 01:10:12,688
- Sit! Eat now.
- My dear, have it my love.

1142
01:10:13,076 --> 01:10:16,205
- Look there...
- [chuckles]

1143
01:10:19,534 --> 01:10:20,478
Where are you?

1144
01:10:20,678 --> 01:10:22,531
Coming home.
Did my baby boy had food or not?

1145
01:10:22,993 --> 01:10:25,076
Shall I pack things?

1146
01:10:25,276 --> 01:10:28,635
Idiot, why are you talking about
packing when I asked if he ate?

1147
01:10:28,835 --> 01:10:33,460
Your boys have been hanging
around Sam Babu's house.

1148
01:10:34,752 --> 01:10:36,997
<i>At Sam Babu's home since morning?</i>

1149
01:10:37,197 --> 01:10:38,828
Why are you saying that so calmly?
Hang up now!

1150
01:10:44,099 --> 01:10:45,628
It's hard for him.

1151
01:10:46,242 --> 01:10:48,415
- Yes?
- What the hell are you doing there?

1152
01:10:48,466 --> 01:10:49,809
Don't you know Maaya went to village?

1153
01:10:50,038 --> 01:10:51,672
- When did that happen?
- What do you mean?

1154
01:10:51,967 --> 01:10:54,468
I saw Sam Babu
dropping her off this morning.

1155
01:10:54,818 --> 01:10:56,781
<i>I assumed you knew it</i>
<i>already, since you were there.</i>

1156
01:10:57,159 --> 01:10:58,581
What do you mean by assuming?

1157
01:11:02,210 --> 01:11:04,770
- Super bowling, man.
- Super, man!

1158
01:11:07,142 --> 01:11:10,572
Hey, he didn't score
a century, he was out!

1159
01:11:10,772 --> 01:11:11,970
- Come on.
- Fine.

1160
01:11:12,170 --> 01:11:14,541
Look at him,
coming like a retired batsman!

1161
01:11:14,741 --> 01:11:15,490
Come dude!

1162
01:11:16,159 --> 01:11:17,462
What about the marriage alliance?

1163
01:11:17,993 --> 01:11:19,192
I liked that girl a lot...

1164
01:11:19,701 --> 01:11:21,267
But she didn't like my age.

1165
01:11:21,742 --> 01:11:23,053
Good lord, the girl got saved.

1166
01:11:23,253 --> 01:11:24,567
Look at the way he's walking.

1167
01:11:24,767 --> 01:11:27,795
I told him she wouldn't fall
for him, and now look at him

1168
01:11:28,034 --> 01:11:29,356
He never listens.

1169
01:11:29,556 --> 01:11:31,130
Why's he walking like that?

1170
01:11:31,330 --> 01:11:32,917
Forget about her, man.

1171
01:11:33,117 --> 01:11:36,040
I'll find a better girl
than her. Forget her.

1172
01:11:37,076 --> 01:11:39,763
Are you running a company,
that you are talking rudely?

1173
01:11:40,010 --> 01:11:41,522
Just say "a girl", man.
It feels good to hear.

1174
01:11:41,993 --> 01:11:43,993
He doesn't even have one
and he's acting like he'll get one.

1175
01:11:44,244 --> 01:11:46,886
- How atrocious!
- Hey, love is linked with the heart,

1176
01:11:47,155 --> 01:11:48,139
not looks.

1177
01:11:48,339 --> 01:11:50,608
Show your skills in the barber shop,

1178
01:11:50,808 --> 01:11:52,290
if you try them here,
I am gonna cut you down.

1179
01:11:52,570 --> 01:11:53,160
Was that enough?

1180
01:11:53,832 --> 01:11:56,676
What did she tell you when she gave
away the note you treasured to the vendor?

1181
01:11:56,863 --> 01:11:58,736
She told you not to
assume because she was before you.

1182
01:11:58,816 --> 01:12:00,664
She's not an "illusion", she's a witch.

1183
01:12:00,904 --> 01:12:02,373
I've to stuff Biryani in her mouth.

1184
01:12:02,685 --> 01:12:03,554
- Huh!
- Ah?

1185
01:12:04,044 --> 01:12:04,845
Brother...

1186
01:12:05,235 --> 01:12:07,926
Do you need to lecture him now?

1187
01:12:08,126 --> 01:12:09,149
I think he felt bad.

1188
01:12:09,349 --> 01:12:10,528
What, shouldn't we feel bad for him?

1189
01:12:11,635 --> 01:12:14,068
We're trying to pull
him out of it, right?

1190
01:12:14,284 --> 01:12:15,941
We arranged this match
for his sake, isn't it?

1191
01:12:18,240 --> 01:12:20,552
And it's all my fault, guys.

1192
01:12:21,368 --> 01:12:23,970
If I'd wooed Maaya first,
he wouldn't had to face this now.

1193
01:12:28,076 --> 01:12:29,739
Unnecessarily, I sacrificed for him.

1194
01:12:34,951 --> 01:12:36,706
- Tell me.
<i>- Come immediately to Manchili...</i>

1195
01:12:36,986 --> 01:12:37,496
What happened?

1196
01:12:37,696 --> 01:12:39,717
<i>Won't you come till I tell you</i>
<i>the reason? Shut up and come over!</i>

1197
01:12:40,909 --> 01:12:42,022
Okay, I'm coming.

1198
01:12:45,576 --> 01:12:47,103
That lady's name is Mary.

1199
01:12:48,659 --> 01:12:51,533
And her granddaughter, is your
Maaya. She's in this house.

1200
01:12:52,099 --> 01:12:52,736
Oh!

1201
01:12:54,243 --> 01:12:56,926
- You're brilliant, man
- Dude, control!

1202
01:12:57,159 --> 01:13:00,702
Hey, if you want to go in, you
need to know about that granny.

1203
01:13:01,951 --> 01:13:04,348
Did you see that, that long stick there!

1204
01:13:04,548 --> 01:13:08,115
- With that stick she'll every time...
- She smacks him with it.

1205
01:13:08,326 --> 01:13:10,409
<i>- Juvva, is that this long?</i>
<i>- Yes, brother.</i>

1206
01:13:10,609 --> 01:13:11,559
<i>It will end up in your bum, got it?</i>

1207
01:13:14,993 --> 01:13:15,993
- Dude...
- Hey!

1208
01:13:16,909 --> 01:13:19,800
Didn't you get it yet?
Let the granny go inside first...

1209
01:13:20,083 --> 01:13:22,871
or she'll beat you with that stick.

1210
01:13:23,139 --> 01:13:25,064
Watch this video, you'll understand.

1211
01:13:25,264 --> 01:13:27,013
- Take a look, it will be nice.
- Oh my God!

1212
01:13:27,993 --> 01:13:30,409
I'll whip your face with a belt, man!

1213
01:13:34,760 --> 01:13:38,249
You've been roaming around
her college, then Relangi...

1214
01:13:38,449 --> 01:13:40,214
and now you're waiting in my village.

1215
01:13:40,633 --> 01:13:43,610
They should give you an award
for "Best Waiting" this year.

1216
01:13:43,765 --> 01:13:45,031
If the award is genuine...

1217
01:13:45,171 --> 01:13:46,291
- What say?
- True brother!

1218
01:13:46,949 --> 01:13:48,572
Thank God, the oldie is going inside.

1219
01:13:48,772 --> 01:13:50,484
- Hey... hey!
- Brother, let him go!

1220
01:13:58,159 --> 01:14:00,911
Hey, why did she grab
his hand like that?

1221
01:14:01,111 --> 01:14:02,846
That's love! Guess mad love, brother.

1222
01:14:15,034 --> 01:14:16,159
I told you not to meet
me again, didn't I?

1223
01:14:16,701 --> 01:14:17,626
Why did you come here again?

1224
01:14:18,256 --> 01:14:20,098
- Maaya that is...
- Don't do these touchy things...

1225
01:14:20,298 --> 01:14:22,304
holding hands and all.

1226
01:14:23,243 --> 01:14:25,988
Just thinking about what
happened makes me sick.

1227
01:14:26,188 --> 01:14:27,552
You were the one who
kissed me, right, Maaya?

1228
01:14:27,752 --> 01:14:30,113
You kissed me, slapped me, you
scold me and then walked away.

1229
01:14:30,346 --> 01:14:31,871
Do you think I won't feel anything?

1230
01:14:37,909 --> 01:14:40,644
Alright, sorry, let's leave that topic!

1231
01:14:40,844 --> 01:14:42,115
Tell me, what's your problem?

1232
01:14:42,315 --> 01:14:44,089
You're my problem.
The problem is you.

1233
01:14:45,409 --> 01:14:48,879
- Me? I'm your problem?
- What about your religion and mine?

1234
01:14:49,326 --> 01:14:51,443
You're an auto driver.
I'm an engineering student.

1235
01:14:51,643 --> 01:14:53,565
Do our lifestyles match anywhere?

1236
01:14:53,765 --> 01:14:56,600
I can look after you
with my auto earnings.

1237
01:14:57,284 --> 01:15:00,237
And religion, these
days, it's not even an issue.

1238
01:15:01,201 --> 01:15:04,163
- I'll talk to everyone in your family.
- How will you convince them?

1239
01:15:05,076 --> 01:15:08,286
If I marry an auto driver
from another religion...

1240
01:15:08,486 --> 01:15:10,407
how will my father hold his head up?

1241
01:15:11,604 --> 01:15:15,240
What happens to his image?
My dad will feel shattered.

1242
01:15:16,826 --> 01:15:18,897
I won't do anything that hurts him.

1243
01:15:20,076 --> 01:15:23,791
My dad gave me more freedom
than I even asked for, as he trust me.

1244
01:15:24,451 --> 01:15:26,101
I don't want to break that.

1245
01:15:31,504 --> 01:15:35,214
<i>My life revolves around my Dad,</i>
<i>college, and church we go on Sundays.</i>

1246
01:15:35,414 --> 01:15:37,307
<i>I don't have anything else except this.</i>

1247
01:15:37,951 --> 01:15:39,789
<i>And now look what you've done to me.</i>

1248
01:15:40,701 --> 01:15:42,765
<i>I'm changing without even realizing.</i>

1249
01:15:43,701 --> 01:15:46,816
<i>If this continues, I'm scared</i>
<i>I'll drift away from my dad...</i>

1250
01:15:47,284 --> 01:15:49,731
and lose his trust as well.

1251
01:15:49,931 --> 01:15:51,954
What have you been doing all this time?

1252
01:15:53,909 --> 01:15:55,357
This won't work for us.

1253
01:15:59,993 --> 01:16:01,981
Don't ever come here to meet me again.

1254
01:16:02,511 --> 01:16:03,790
- Oh no!
- Brother...

1255
01:16:03,990 --> 01:16:05,588
- Yeah!
- Uncle! Uncle! Don't take him wrong!

1256
01:16:07,534 --> 01:16:08,836
Oh God, he's lost it.

1257
01:16:09,036 --> 01:16:12,909
[music]

1258
01:16:29,909 --> 01:16:34,368
"This is how maidens seem to be"

1259
01:16:34,576 --> 01:16:38,451
"Fair as angels, sly as devils in beauty"

1260
01:16:41,868 --> 01:16:45,451
"They tangle hearts with silent art"

1261
01:16:45,794 --> 01:16:49,451
"Enigmas no scholar could truly study"

1262
01:16:49,772 --> 01:16:52,909
"Soft in form, yet fierce in play"

1263
01:16:53,422 --> 01:16:56,584
"They steal one's peace, then drift away"

1264
01:16:56,960 --> 01:17:00,375
"They propose us, and
then they do a preview..."

1265
01:17:00,701 --> 01:17:04,194
"They say, it's just a waste of time!"

1266
01:17:04,409 --> 01:17:11,208
"How long must this theatre run?
Their love, a show for everyone"

1267
01:17:11,759 --> 01:17:15,427
"Oh heavens, behold these ladies bright"

1268
01:17:15,627 --> 01:17:18,727
"If we say 'right'...
They insist it's 'left'."

1269
01:17:19,159 --> 01:17:22,781
"Poor one, is always the man"

1270
01:17:22,981 --> 01:17:26,377
"He is like a dog!"

1271
01:17:40,576 --> 01:17:44,201
- "How do we deal with them, Lord?
- How, how?"

1272
01:17:44,701 --> 01:17:47,868
- "Is there such a thing as justice?
- How, how?"

1273
01:17:48,409 --> 01:17:51,785
"So many religions in the
world, yet love is just one"

1274
01:17:52,159 --> 01:17:55,288
- "Two hearts involved, yet still...
- How, how?"

1275
01:17:55,488 --> 01:17:59,504
"You place them in the front
row while you stay behind"

1276
01:17:59,704 --> 01:18:02,963
"What's this, God, this is very sad!"

1277
01:18:05,909 --> 01:18:10,232
"If they fantasize us,
they'll show a little kindness"

1278
01:18:10,880 --> 01:18:13,909
"If not, they'll leave
without a second thought"

1279
01:18:14,173 --> 01:18:14,913
"Oh dear!"

1280
01:18:18,084 --> 01:18:21,326
"They show affection
through fleeting smiles"

1281
01:18:21,659 --> 01:18:25,577
- "Yet scold us the moment they're cross.
- Indeed!"

1282
01:18:25,784 --> 01:18:28,993
"They call it a lie
when we speak the truth"

1283
01:18:29,284 --> 01:18:32,451
"And grow upset for no clear reason"

1284
01:18:32,993 --> 01:18:36,356
"They'll believe our fibs..."

1285
01:18:36,768 --> 01:18:39,832
"The come to a compromise!"

1286
01:18:40,409 --> 01:18:43,909
"She's a dad's little
princess, yet bold beside me..."

1287
01:18:44,146 --> 01:18:47,095
"And somehow,
I've lost track of time!"

1288
01:18:47,784 --> 01:18:51,319
"Oh heavens, look how swiftly they move!"

1289
01:18:51,519 --> 01:18:54,826
"Setting trends,
then vanishing just as fast"

1290
01:18:55,159 --> 01:18:58,692
"And if we try to
understand their minds..."

1291
01:18:58,892 --> 01:19:02,108
"they say even minimum
degree won't suffice"

1292
01:19:04,243 --> 01:19:08,243
[music]

1293
01:19:41,576 --> 01:19:44,739
<i>- Your lipstick tastes so good.</i>
- You don't have any shame.

1294
01:19:45,489 --> 01:19:47,164
<i>Why should I feel shame with you?</i>

1295
01:19:49,090 --> 01:19:54,016
[Telugu News running over TV]

1296
01:20:01,868 --> 01:20:04,388
Put the news on,
why are you changing channels?

1297
01:20:04,588 --> 01:20:07,886
Why do you need news these days,
Granny? You're being a nerd.

1298
01:20:08,682 --> 01:20:09,576
Nothing like that, dear.

1299
01:20:09,815 --> 01:20:15,777
Your grandad used to watch the 9 pm
news every day, no matter what.

1300
01:20:15,977 --> 01:20:20,905
I feel like he's still with me,
if I watch these news!

1301
01:20:23,076 --> 01:20:24,711
Did grandfather take good care of you?

1302
01:20:24,911 --> 01:20:26,987
Even though he did daily labour,

1303
01:20:27,187 --> 01:20:32,199
he took care of me and your dad.

1304
01:20:34,493 --> 01:20:38,172
Maaya? Maaya... What happened?

1305
01:20:40,701 --> 01:20:44,782
After marriage,
you'll love your husband...

1306
01:20:44,982 --> 01:20:46,792
then you'll understand.

1307
01:20:51,166 --> 01:20:52,712
<i>Look at your father.</i>

1308
01:20:53,122 --> 01:20:59,077
<i>Since you were born,</i>
<i>he's been doing that watchman job,</i>

1309
01:20:59,377 --> 01:21:02,441
<i>just to protect you from anything.</i>

1310
01:21:08,909 --> 01:21:11,183
- Hey, old man, who is Raju here?
- Yeah?

1311
01:21:12,826 --> 01:21:13,985
That guy, sir.

1312
01:21:14,185 --> 01:21:16,295
Son, are you Raju?

1313
01:21:16,826 --> 01:21:18,398
- Yes, sir.
- Come to the station.

1314
01:21:18,701 --> 01:21:19,201
What happened, sir?

1315
01:21:19,493 --> 01:21:22,978
So after trying to rape a girl last
night, you're looking for customers?

1316
01:21:23,178 --> 01:21:24,340
- What are you talking about, sir?
- Hey, come!

1317
01:21:24,701 --> 01:21:26,577
- Sir, who are you talking about?
- Come on!

1318
01:21:26,993 --> 01:21:29,267
Sir, this boy is very decent.

1319
01:21:29,467 --> 01:21:30,814
- He is very decent guy, sir.
- Old man,

1320
01:21:31,014 --> 01:21:33,030
if you've got anything
to say, talk to SI at the station.

1321
01:21:37,058 --> 01:21:38,591
There are only two kinds
of people here, sir.

1322
01:21:38,973 --> 01:21:40,653
One will kill you with hospitality.

1323
01:21:40,951 --> 01:21:42,308
The other will kill you in
the name of hospitality.

1324
01:21:43,409 --> 01:21:45,789
I'm satisfied with the job,

1325
01:21:45,993 --> 01:21:47,742
but it's bad for my health.

1326
01:21:48,009 --> 01:21:49,699
- Please look after my transfer, sir.
- You are mistaken something.

1327
01:21:49,993 --> 01:21:53,842
- Stand properly.
- Sir... Sir, I'll call you again.

1328
01:21:54,042 --> 01:21:55,392
Here came a macho man.

1329
01:21:57,868 --> 01:21:58,695
Fold your hands.

1330
01:21:58,895 --> 01:21:59,452
What?

1331
01:21:59,868 --> 01:22:03,831
You tried to rape Rekha yesterday?

1332
01:22:04,201 --> 01:22:06,656
Sir? I don't even know who Rekha is.

1333
01:22:07,201 --> 01:22:09,036
Last night at 8:30...

1334
01:22:09,236 --> 01:22:12,170
You went from Velpuri to Athili
with a customer, remember?

1335
01:22:14,085 --> 01:22:15,490
You don't have any shame

1336
01:22:17,993 --> 01:22:19,808
I'm scared...

1337
01:22:20,008 --> 01:22:21,507
If Dad hears this, he'll tear us apart.

1338
01:22:21,707 --> 01:22:24,011
I need to cook up a story and cover it.

1339
01:22:30,669 --> 01:22:31,741
Pull over.

1340
01:22:36,284 --> 01:22:38,782
What, brother, you remember her now?

1341
01:22:39,183 --> 01:22:40,703
That girl is Rekha!

1342
01:22:41,159 --> 01:22:44,409
Throw this skinny guy in and
beat him till his bones crack.

1343
01:22:44,609 --> 01:22:45,701
- Come on, move inside.
- Move!

1344
01:22:45,940 --> 01:22:51,393
He should wet himself even if
they just think about women.

1345
01:22:51,732 --> 01:22:52,646
Get in.

1346
01:22:53,638 --> 01:22:54,701
I can't stand his
screams, hit him harder.

1347
01:22:55,284 --> 01:22:58,135
Speak out!
You did it, right!

1348
01:22:58,335 --> 01:23:00,860
Come on, guys! Come on.

1349
01:23:01,060 --> 01:23:02,705
Let's see if it's cops
or us today. Come on!

1350
01:23:02,905 --> 01:23:04,712
Surround the station! Come on.

1351
01:23:08,036 --> 01:23:10,951
Hey, Open the gates!
[indistinct voices]

1352
01:23:11,451 --> 01:23:13,483
- Open the gates!
- [indistinct voices]

1353
01:23:13,683 --> 01:23:16,893
If you don't,
we'll burn this station down!

1354
01:23:17,390 --> 01:23:18,572
Hey, the media is here.

1355
01:23:18,772 --> 01:23:19,637
They've come at the right time.

1356
01:23:20,076 --> 01:23:21,082
Raju is very good guy...

1357
01:23:21,282 --> 01:23:23,375
Unjustly they have filed a fake
rape case and threw him in jail.

1358
01:23:23,575 --> 01:23:25,192
If the girl filed the case,
she should be here, right?

1359
01:23:25,392 --> 01:23:26,503
Where is she?
They should show her, right?

1360
01:23:26,819 --> 01:23:29,309
[indistinct voices]

1361
01:23:29,512 --> 01:23:31,757
Idiot, stop this,
they didn't file FIR on him yet!

1362
01:23:32,057 --> 01:23:34,038
I am the president sir, let me in!

1363
01:23:34,238 --> 01:23:36,993
[sloganeering]

1364
01:23:37,409 --> 01:23:39,090
- Speak out, man!
- Hey!

1365
01:23:39,784 --> 01:23:44,701
What, Raju... So women are a
joke to you auto drivers, are they?

1366
01:23:45,096 --> 01:23:48,329
You take them to the outskirts,
rape them, record it...

1367
01:23:48,529 --> 01:23:52,405
then blackmail them with
the videos, you scoundrel!

1368
01:23:52,605 --> 01:23:53,116
Sir...

1369
01:23:54,468 --> 01:23:58,195
Wastrels like you should
be killed on the road itself.

1370
01:24:00,481 --> 01:24:06,162
[phone rings]
I can't do this!

1371
01:24:06,451 --> 01:24:08,155
- What needs to be done, huh?
<i>- One minute, sir.</i>

1372
01:24:08,355 --> 01:24:09,357
- Do you know what I can do?
<i>- I'll call SI sir.</i>

1373
01:24:09,557 --> 01:24:10,907
- I'll crush your bones, you scoundrel!
<i>- Sir...</i>

1374
01:24:11,576 --> 01:24:12,655
<i>- Sir!</i>
- Sir...

1375
01:24:12,909 --> 01:24:15,096
<i>- What?</i>
<i>- Rekha's dad is on the call.</i>

1376
01:24:15,296 --> 01:24:15,946
Ask him why?

1377
01:24:16,172 --> 01:24:17,184
He wants to talk with you, sir.

1378
01:24:21,284 --> 01:24:23,561
- Here, sir.
- Tell me, sir.

1379
01:24:27,701 --> 01:24:29,659
Your daughter is now became
headlines in the news, right.

1380
01:24:30,128 --> 01:24:32,827
Pride matters more than justice.

1381
01:24:35,590 --> 01:24:38,409
Wastrels like him, were being
carefree because of you useless.

1382
01:24:39,201 --> 01:24:40,826
Hang up, sir. Hang now.

1383
01:24:41,899 --> 01:24:42,899
- Leave him.
- Sir?

1384
01:24:43,343 --> 01:24:44,618
- Leave him.
- Okay, sir.

1385
01:24:46,048 --> 01:24:49,239
Go and happily, wait!
Straighten his shirt.

1386
01:24:49,534 --> 01:24:50,605
Straighten his shirt.

1387
01:24:50,826 --> 01:24:51,844
- Sir...
- And tidy his hair too.

1388
01:24:52,284 --> 01:24:54,753
Sir has fans outside.
Go, sir.

1389
01:24:55,368 --> 01:24:58,894
Now they talk about pride. These
people don't even understand pride.

1390
01:24:59,094 --> 01:25:00,953
And I'm sidekick among these...

1391
01:25:05,826 --> 01:25:06,946
- Sit down.
- Yes, sir.

1392
01:25:07,146 --> 01:25:08,136
- Sit now!
- Alright, sir!

1393
01:25:08,693 --> 01:25:10,325
- Stop!
- Hey, it's Raju!

1394
01:25:12,996 --> 01:25:17,219
<i>Velpuru auto driver Raju accused</i>
<i>of molesting a college student.</i>

1395
01:25:17,419 --> 01:25:20,428
<i>Velpuru police have</i>
<i>taken him into custody.</i>

1396
01:25:20,628 --> 01:25:21,788
- Please stop, all of you.
- Let's go inside.

1397
01:25:21,988 --> 01:25:23,674
I'm fine. Send everyone back.

1398
01:25:23,874 --> 01:25:28,595
<i>However, fellow drivers and</i>
<i>friends insist Raju is innocent.</i>

1399
01:25:30,741 --> 01:25:31,448
Look now!

1400
01:25:31,724 --> 01:25:34,398
Ignore about her nonsense,
what happened to her dad?

1401
01:25:34,598 --> 01:25:36,473
Every idiot is ready
to mock auto drivers.

1402
01:25:36,673 --> 01:25:38,724
Hey, come with me,
let's file a reverse case.

1403
01:25:38,960 --> 01:25:40,356
Dude... Ignore it,

1404
01:25:40,556 --> 01:25:42,448
her father came and apologized, right?

1405
01:25:42,648 --> 01:25:44,962
They are projecting him as
rapist, how we can ignore it?

1406
01:25:45,162 --> 01:25:45,787
Hey...

1407
01:25:46,516 --> 01:25:50,886
Everyone will forget about the incident
that happened to a guy in a week.

1408
01:25:51,474 --> 01:25:53,793
If a girl gets a mark...

1409
01:25:53,993 --> 01:25:56,024
She'll have to carry
that till her end of life.

1410
01:25:56,724 --> 01:25:59,943
Everyone will look at
her as if she's a criminal.

1411
01:26:00,474 --> 01:26:01,507
Including you!

1412
01:26:01,707 --> 01:26:02,620
You said it right, uncle.

1413
01:26:04,933 --> 01:26:08,194
Come on! Feeling as if you
are some great person's lineage!

1414
01:26:09,474 --> 01:26:10,454
Well said, dude.

1415
01:26:11,099 --> 01:26:12,747
They are relatives of Vivekananda.

1416
01:26:13,266 --> 01:26:14,965
- Maaya...
- Why did he got her here?

1417
01:26:15,558 --> 01:26:17,422
When did you come? How are you doing?

1418
01:26:17,622 --> 01:26:19,205
Did you just came? Please come in.

1419
01:26:19,405 --> 01:26:21,916
Keep your bag there,
brother-in-law, move aside.

1420
01:26:22,116 --> 01:26:24,145
Sit here, please.
I'll apply this to brother-in-law.

1421
01:26:24,348 --> 01:26:25,415
How's your father doing?

1422
01:26:25,615 --> 01:26:26,976
- Yes, good!
- Bag...

1423
01:26:28,051 --> 01:26:29,936
Hey, what she's doing here?

1424
01:26:30,136 --> 01:26:32,624
She came to my home and
asked me to bring here!

1425
01:26:32,824 --> 01:26:34,604
I think girl got melted!

1426
01:26:35,099 --> 01:26:37,473
Maaya, what's with you so suddenly here?

1427
01:26:37,673 --> 01:26:41,530
Mom, dad, come here,
I'll introduce a special friend to you.

1428
01:26:42,266 --> 01:26:43,724
- Who is that?
- Maaya, mom.

1429
01:26:44,141 --> 01:26:47,694
- She's my close friend.
- What dear, how are you?

1430
01:26:48,058 --> 01:26:49,945
When did you come? Sit down!

1431
01:26:51,391 --> 01:26:53,872
Samaikya, did you gave her water?

1432
01:26:54,072 --> 01:26:56,753
Learn doing some hospitality.
A girl have to...

1433
01:26:57,891 --> 01:26:59,939
- Fine, go now.
- She always give tasks to me.

1434
01:27:00,740 --> 01:27:04,013
What, dear, are you parents
doing good? What your dad do?

1435
01:27:04,324 --> 01:27:06,361
- Greetings, uncle
- Dear...

1436
01:27:06,648 --> 01:27:08,762
She's Maaya, our Samaikya's friend.

1437
01:27:09,858 --> 01:27:12,441
- Is everyone at home doing well, dear?
- Everyone is fine, Uncle.

1438
01:27:13,107 --> 01:27:14,441
- Look after her.
- Okay.

1439
01:27:14,566 --> 01:27:17,483
I'm going to the fields to
water them. Sit down, dear.

1440
01:27:20,107 --> 01:27:21,233
- Take it.
- Have it.

1441
01:27:22,107 --> 01:27:24,650
Do you need anything else, Maaya?

1442
01:27:25,399 --> 01:27:26,107
No.

1443
01:27:27,858 --> 01:27:28,900
[sharp hiss]

1444
01:27:30,233 --> 01:27:31,316
Nothing to worry!

1445
01:27:33,233 --> 01:27:35,775
They're just minor bruises.
He'll recover in a couple of days.

1446
01:27:36,107 --> 01:27:38,775
He gets bigger bruises than
these when he plays cricket.

1447
01:27:38,900 --> 01:27:41,566
- We're used to this, don't bother.
- Dinner is ready!

1448
01:27:43,566 --> 01:27:45,608
Come on, Maaya.
Let's have food together.

1449
01:27:48,066 --> 01:27:49,650
No, Aunt. I should
get going home.

1450
01:27:49,775 --> 01:27:52,191
You came here for the first time, and
now you want to leave without food?

1451
01:27:52,358 --> 01:27:53,191
- Samaikya...
- Mom?

1452
01:27:53,274 --> 01:27:54,358
get her a plate.

1453
01:27:55,691 --> 01:27:58,024
She comes near
food just like a dog!

1454
01:27:58,775 --> 01:27:59,483
Nothing!

1455
01:28:01,441 --> 01:28:02,191
Here it is, mom!

1456
01:28:02,441 --> 01:28:03,191
Take it.

1457
01:28:03,983 --> 01:28:05,524
Why did you bring only two plates?

1458
01:28:05,900 --> 01:28:06,816
Let's all eat together.

1459
01:28:06,983 --> 01:28:09,399
At our home, everyone
eats only after Mom is done.

1460
01:28:09,900 --> 01:28:13,358
But today, since you're
our guest, you're special.

1461
01:28:14,775 --> 01:28:17,816
A mother is the main reason for
a home's prosperity, right, Maaya?

1462
01:28:18,066 --> 01:28:20,942
- From dawn to dusk...
- Enough serving.

1463
01:28:21,066 --> 01:28:23,483
she toils hard and look
the happiness in her child.

1464
01:28:23,816 --> 01:28:26,441
One day of her leave
is enough to ruin our day.

1465
01:28:26,775 --> 01:28:27,816
That whole day feels off.

1466
01:28:27,983 --> 01:28:29,650
We believe Mother is keenly
essential in prosperity of home.

1467
01:28:30,066 --> 01:28:31,483
That's why, our Mother will eat first.

1468
01:28:31,733 --> 01:28:32,524
And then rest of us.

1469
01:28:35,358 --> 01:28:38,524
Hold on! Hold on!
Rahman's special Mutton curry is here.

1470
01:28:38,816 --> 01:28:39,775
- Hell with him.
- Enough.

1471
01:28:43,441 --> 01:28:45,024
- Mom, feed me a little.
- Okay!

1472
01:28:45,274 --> 01:28:46,441
Mother-in-law, for me?

1473
01:28:46,691 --> 01:28:47,942
[phone ringing]

1474
01:28:48,233 --> 01:28:50,191
Now you're done for.

1475
01:28:50,358 --> 01:28:51,233
Won't you come back to home?

1476
01:28:51,399 --> 01:28:54,608
Karuna, it's only 8 PM,
right? I'm on my way!

1477
01:28:54,942 --> 01:28:57,149
I know you need blouse cloth,
right? I'll get it for you. End the call.

1478
01:28:57,483 --> 01:28:58,858
Tell him later that I already left.

1479
01:28:59,066 --> 01:28:59,691
- Go...
- Hmm!

1480
01:29:00,149 --> 01:29:01,274
Don't forget the blouse pieces!

1481
01:29:04,566 --> 01:29:07,024
How many times have I told
you not to promote betting apps?

1482
01:29:08,066 --> 01:29:09,816
You love our Raju, right?

1483
01:29:12,524 --> 01:29:15,441
Alright, tell me when
you're ready to confess.

1484
01:29:15,691 --> 01:29:16,274
Aunt!

1485
01:29:17,900 --> 01:29:18,524
What, dear?

1486
01:29:19,483 --> 01:29:21,107
I'm unable to understand.

1487
01:29:22,066 --> 01:29:23,233
You are living in harmony.

1488
01:29:23,608 --> 01:29:24,816
And giving me so much love.

1489
01:29:26,399 --> 01:29:29,399
Whether you know it
or not, we're Christians!

1490
01:29:32,107 --> 01:29:35,733
I... I honestly don't
know what to do!

1491
01:29:36,483 --> 01:29:39,191
Dumbo! Were you lost
about this mere thing?

1492
01:29:41,107 --> 01:29:42,733
You think we're Hindus, right?

1493
01:29:43,316 --> 01:29:43,942
Hmm!

1494
01:29:44,483 --> 01:29:46,816
I'm not a Hindu,
I'm a Muslim.

1495
01:29:47,691 --> 01:29:49,691
My name is Zubeda,
Zubeda Begum.

1496
01:29:51,483 --> 01:29:53,566
That's true. Uncle is a Hindu.

1497
01:29:54,274 --> 01:29:56,733
And I'm a Muslim. Ours
was a love marriage.

1498
01:29:58,733 --> 01:30:00,399
In our whole marriage life...

1499
01:30:00,983 --> 01:30:04,024
we never fought or had a
chaos over religion.

1500
01:30:04,650 --> 01:30:05,316
Do you know that?

1501
01:30:08,233 --> 01:30:09,358
After our marriage...

1502
01:30:09,942 --> 01:30:11,149
not just only our lives...

1503
01:30:11,983 --> 01:30:13,441
we even shared our religion beliefs, too!

1504
01:30:14,816 --> 01:30:17,566
Dear, this papaya is from our garden.

1505
01:30:17,733 --> 01:30:19,233
- This tastes soo good, have it.
- Take it, dear.

1506
01:30:20,107 --> 01:30:22,566
- Come.
- Did you feed the cow?

1507
01:30:22,733 --> 01:30:25,775
How can I forget that? If I do so,
will you and her let me live?

1508
01:30:25,900 --> 01:30:27,691
- Won't you both kill me.
- Enough, move over.

1509
01:30:30,942 --> 01:30:31,650
Muslim?

1510
01:30:34,733 --> 01:30:35,775
Zubeda Begum?

1511
01:30:38,951 --> 01:30:39,900
Enough, sister!

1512
01:30:45,315 --> 01:30:46,733
Samaikya Begum!

1513
01:30:47,822 --> 01:30:49,031
Hey, where have you gone?

1514
01:30:49,698 --> 01:30:50,733
Go and bring the curry.

1515
01:30:52,024 --> 01:30:53,483
Why do you need this? Get the Rasam.

1516
01:30:55,399 --> 01:30:56,400
Here's the curry.

1517
01:30:57,608 --> 01:30:59,066
She's killing me with her glances.

1518
01:30:59,274 --> 01:31:00,650
Do I have to say it specially?
Go and get a plate for yourself.

1519
01:31:02,399 --> 01:31:04,900
What are you doing,
yapping with my aunt? Get in!

1520
01:31:05,066 --> 01:31:06,107
She doesn't even have basic sense.

1521
01:31:06,233 --> 01:31:07,691
Why are you holding
the plate like a beggar?

1522
01:31:07,942 --> 01:31:09,441
- Have it.
- Serve more!

1523
01:31:11,650 --> 01:31:12,233
Hey, I don't want this.

1524
01:31:12,900 --> 01:31:14,107
- I only want that!
- Hey?

1525
01:31:14,983 --> 01:31:16,274
Well, I need only that dish!

1526
01:31:18,191 --> 01:31:19,149
- Hey.
- Hmm!

1527
01:31:19,942 --> 01:31:21,608
I don't know why, but I
really want to get married.

1528
01:31:21,816 --> 01:31:22,942
Of course, you will.

1529
01:31:23,024 --> 01:31:25,149
How on earth are you still
alive without getting married?

1530
01:31:25,524 --> 01:31:27,900
- Darn it.
- Useless idiot.

1531
01:31:28,233 --> 01:31:31,650
He can't even find a bride, but
he's giving crap about my marriage.

1532
01:31:33,066 --> 01:31:33,816
Come on, have it.

1533
01:31:35,274 --> 01:31:37,358
Uncle, did you take your diabetes tablets?

1534
01:31:37,524 --> 01:31:40,274
I'm not diabetic,
will have one, once I'm diabetic.

1535
01:31:40,474 --> 01:31:42,140
- Idiot.
- Oh my, you're not diabetic?

1536
01:31:42,492 --> 01:31:43,529
It's too late.

1537
01:31:43,819 --> 01:31:46,437
- Juvva, tell her to serve some curry.
- Hey, Ramu, take this.

1538
01:31:48,524 --> 01:31:50,066
Sister, brother is asking for curry.

1539
01:31:50,858 --> 01:31:53,900
Idiot, why are you making
us brother and sister!

1540
01:31:54,608 --> 01:31:55,775
Eat it all.

1541
01:31:56,691 --> 01:32:00,483
Rehman with Samaikya!
I will name our kid Rekya.

1542
01:32:02,191 --> 01:32:02,942
Careful, dear.

1543
01:32:03,149 --> 01:32:04,358
- Bye aunty!
- Bye, Maaya.

1544
01:32:04,816 --> 01:32:05,524
Bye.

1545
01:32:06,024 --> 01:32:07,483
What, won't you guys come?

1546
01:32:07,858 --> 01:32:09,024
- Yes, let's go.
- Shall I go, dear?

1547
01:32:09,399 --> 01:32:10,608
Can't you able to hear?
Get lost.

1548
01:32:10,942 --> 01:32:12,524
- Can't you able to hear? Get lost.
- You leave!

1549
01:32:15,650 --> 01:32:17,191
[cicadas chirping]

1550
01:32:17,318 --> 01:32:18,383
[clears throat]

1551
01:32:19,416 --> 01:32:20,436
Sorry.

1552
01:32:21,402 --> 01:32:23,110
Girls do have mood swings.

1553
01:32:23,858 --> 01:32:26,024
We don't even know
what we will yap at those times.

1554
01:32:26,566 --> 01:32:28,483
I yapped like hell at that time.

1555
01:32:29,608 --> 01:32:31,816
After that, I came back
to you on my own, right?

1556
01:32:32,233 --> 01:32:35,900
Till how long, you will have that
serious face, come on smile for me!

1557
01:32:37,566 --> 01:32:40,608
Please... please! Please!

1558
01:32:41,024 --> 01:32:43,358
For sake of me,
just give a smile. Please.

1559
01:32:43,608 --> 01:32:46,107
Why, aren't we
supposed to have mood swings?

1560
01:32:46,691 --> 01:32:47,316
What?

1561
01:32:47,900 --> 01:32:49,233
You also have mood swings?

1562
01:32:49,983 --> 01:32:51,483
Fine, I'll fix your mood.

1563
01:32:53,566 --> 01:32:54,691
Take this and get convinced.

1564
01:32:57,650 --> 01:33:01,816
Or should I go into the pond
and bring you lotus flowers?

1565
01:33:02,483 --> 01:33:03,900
Will you get convinced then, sir?

1566
01:33:11,566 --> 01:33:13,149
Even we know how to act.

1567
01:33:14,399 --> 01:33:15,066
Idiot.

1568
01:33:15,274 --> 01:33:15,942
God!

1569
01:33:16,358 --> 01:33:17,858
Sorry, sorry, I forgot
about your injury.

1570
01:33:23,149 --> 01:33:27,233
You are so great, Raju.
You took the blame without your mistake.

1571
01:33:28,066 --> 01:33:29,983
One needs a lot
of guts to do that.

1572
01:33:31,650 --> 01:33:34,983
None will dare to do what you
have done today in a girl issue!

1573
01:33:35,816 --> 01:33:37,233
I know you don't do anything wrong.

1574
01:33:37,775 --> 01:33:39,316
That's why, I came to you immediately.

1575
01:33:40,066 --> 01:33:42,024
By seeing you with those
bruises at your home...

1576
01:33:42,900 --> 01:33:46,399
I... I can't stop my
tears, you know.

1577
01:33:48,024 --> 01:33:50,233
Hey, Maaya! Why
are you crying now?

1578
01:33:50,816 --> 01:33:51,858
Nothing happened to me, right?

1579
01:33:52,816 --> 01:33:54,399
Look, how easily I'm doing my work here.

1580
01:33:56,024 --> 01:33:58,316
Don't ruin my auto
with your tears.

1581
01:33:58,650 --> 01:34:00,066
I'll end up cleaning
it like I'm going to die.

1582
01:34:03,274 --> 01:34:06,858
I keep wondering how you
always stay so positive, dude.

1583
01:34:07,566 --> 01:34:08,233
Dude?

1584
01:34:08,691 --> 01:34:10,691
I'll even call you ÒdoucheÓ
too. Any problem?

1585
01:34:13,441 --> 01:34:15,441
Today I realized it by seeing your family.

1586
01:34:16,399 --> 01:34:18,024
How well they have raised you.

1587
01:34:18,942 --> 01:34:21,358
You are great, Raa... ju!

1588
01:34:22,691 --> 01:34:23,441
Oh!

1589
01:34:23,858 --> 01:34:24,441
It's Okay!

1590
01:34:24,983 --> 01:34:27,775
Leave you aside, I don't
think your dad will like me.

1591
01:34:27,983 --> 01:34:30,942
If I like you, my dad is
sure to like you as well.

1592
01:34:31,483 --> 01:34:32,191
So, what now?

1593
01:34:38,399 --> 01:34:40,483
Is this all real, or is
there some twist again?

1594
01:34:42,524 --> 01:34:43,399
Tell me this.

1595
01:34:44,274 --> 01:34:46,316
Who's more beautiful,
me or your sister-in-law?

1596
01:34:46,816 --> 01:34:48,024
Lakshmi, obviously.

1597
01:34:49,483 --> 01:34:51,399
But I feel so comfortable
when I'm with you.

1598
01:34:51,816 --> 01:34:52,942
Movie dialogues again?

1599
01:34:53,149 --> 01:34:55,608
I swear, this is my own dialogue!

1600
01:34:56,107 --> 01:34:57,191
Trust me, please.

1601
01:35:17,191 --> 01:35:18,483
- Hi dad!
- Hi, my cutiepie.

1602
01:35:19,107 --> 01:35:19,983
What's up, dear?

1603
01:35:21,403 --> 01:35:23,441
My friend Samaikya is getting married.

1604
01:35:29,274 --> 01:35:30,983
Uncle, why won't you
attend the wedding?

1605
01:35:31,149 --> 01:35:33,107
No, dear. You all go ahead.

1606
01:35:33,245 --> 01:35:34,316
- Take care, Dad.
- Okay!

1607
01:35:34,473 --> 01:35:37,640
"What more could we
possibly ask for than this?"

1608
01:35:41,989 --> 01:35:47,823
"You for me, and I for you,
Love lives between the two of us..."

1609
01:35:48,733 --> 01:35:51,858
"What more could we
possibly ask for than this?"

1610
01:35:54,955 --> 01:35:56,024
He is from our category.

1611
01:35:57,091 --> 01:36:02,591
"Every reality feels like a dream..."

1612
01:36:02,816 --> 01:36:07,775
"In the sky filled with celebration
We are like birds flying freely."

1613
01:36:07,901 --> 01:36:10,734
"You and I in love..."

1614
01:36:11,149 --> 01:36:14,107
"What more could we
possibly ask for than this?"

1615
01:36:16,775 --> 01:36:17,608
Come with me!

1616
01:36:19,591 --> 01:36:20,883
I'm in love with your sister!

1617
01:36:22,410 --> 01:36:24,274
When did you start loving my sister?

1618
01:36:24,425 --> 01:36:26,133
The moment I learned
your mom is a Muslim.

1619
01:36:26,342 --> 01:36:27,030
What?

1620
01:36:27,264 --> 01:36:31,013
You're not only Raju, you're
Shaik Kill Bill Mohammad Raju, idiot.

1621
01:36:31,291 --> 01:36:33,124
- Get lost.
- Trust me, it's true, man

1622
01:36:33,858 --> 01:36:36,358
Just imagine what'll
happen if she finds out.

1623
01:36:36,524 --> 01:36:39,608
[woman scolding in background]

1624
01:36:40,476 --> 01:36:43,524
You'll move on to ten other
girls before her marriage.

1625
01:36:43,733 --> 01:36:45,274
- Let's go!
- I've changed.

1626
01:36:47,733 --> 01:36:50,107
Grandpa, does anyone
here know black magic?

1627
01:36:50,191 --> 01:36:51,233
You look like one!

1628
01:36:51,472 --> 01:36:52,441
Don't roam in village.

1629
01:36:53,727 --> 01:36:55,942
Daughter of Sam Babu...
semester topper!

1630
01:36:57,566 --> 01:37:02,733
"You and I in love..."

1631
01:37:03,566 --> 01:37:08,233
"What more could we possibly
ask for than this?"

1632
01:37:11,524 --> 01:37:12,983
On one hand, she's
doing well in her studies.

1633
01:37:14,191 --> 01:37:16,191
And on the other, she's
exploring so many new things.

1634
01:37:17,274 --> 01:37:18,358
I can't understand her.

1635
01:37:18,942 --> 01:37:21,650
Don't overthink it and
stress yourself out.

1636
01:37:22,566 --> 01:37:24,358
They're still kids.

1637
01:37:24,900 --> 01:37:28,358
We should guide them the right
way and make them understand.

1638
01:37:29,608 --> 01:37:32,024
Alright, then ask her
if she's seeing someone.

1639
01:37:32,107 --> 01:37:34,858
That way we'll know what to do.
Don't rush into conclusions.

1640
01:37:43,858 --> 01:37:45,942
- Brother-in-law, how is my dress?
- Superb.

1641
01:37:46,024 --> 01:37:46,775
Maaya?

1642
01:37:51,024 --> 01:37:52,274
[music mutes voices]

1643
01:37:55,024 --> 01:37:58,233
So you've finally agreed I'm
prettier than your sister-in-law.

1644
01:37:58,942 --> 01:38:01,775
- Me?
- But your eyes exposed you, Mr. Raju.

1645
01:38:04,650 --> 01:38:06,233
Can you wear these shades?

1646
01:38:06,733 --> 01:38:07,942
Go on, she's reading your mind.

1647
01:38:09,650 --> 01:38:11,775
Oh my, look at him blushing!

1648
01:38:12,024 --> 01:38:13,775
[booing]

1649
01:38:15,524 --> 01:38:18,066
Hey, why are you like that?
they gave you the catering contract right?

1650
01:38:18,233 --> 01:38:19,816
They gave only the contract
not their girl right?

1651
01:38:20,191 --> 01:38:22,983
They're marrying her to
him for her good future.

1652
01:38:24,274 --> 01:38:25,942
That's how you ended up
with a witch for a wife.

1653
01:38:26,149 --> 01:38:27,274
Yeah, wait for Mumtaz Begum
for you then!

1654
01:38:27,444 --> 01:38:29,111
- Mark my words, I'll marry Mumtaz.
- Fool!

1655
01:38:29,361 --> 01:38:30,778
You'll all die of jealousy.

1656
01:38:38,650 --> 01:38:39,816
Wow!

1657
01:38:40,566 --> 01:38:42,107
Mumtaz.

1658
01:38:42,233 --> 01:38:47,983
This sacred thread,
is the very reason of life

1659
01:38:48,274 --> 01:38:53,900
I'm tying around your neck, may you live
a century autumns with me

1660
01:39:10,733 --> 01:39:13,983
The scene has brightened
a thousand times over

1661
01:39:19,233 --> 01:39:20,524
You could've worn a nicer shirt, right?

1662
01:39:21,541 --> 01:39:22,792
I lost my taste long ago.

1663
01:39:22,916 --> 01:39:24,083
I'll burst crackers once
the wedding's done.

1664
01:39:25,416 --> 01:39:27,874
Hey, it's time to serve food, come on.

1665
01:39:28,626 --> 01:39:30,126
- I'll be back in a bit. I will.
- Where to?

1666
01:39:30,291 --> 01:39:30,833
Come on!

1667
01:39:30,999 --> 01:39:33,124
"The kohl hidden just beneath the eye..."

1668
01:39:33,291 --> 01:39:37,416
"Without even the
tiniest trace of darkness."

1669
01:39:38,874 --> 01:39:41,792
"I remain with you in complete trust."

1670
01:39:44,792 --> 01:39:47,874
"From now on, every step you take..."

1671
01:39:49,874 --> 01:39:52,041
"I will carry you gently
in the palm of my hand."

1672
01:39:52,166 --> 01:39:55,416
Show her the star properly.
From tomorrow, you'll see real stars.

1673
01:39:55,916 --> 01:40:00,750
- "Beloved, the heart is like a lotus..."
- "Is it a burden too heavy to hold?"

1674
01:40:01,083 --> 01:40:07,083
- "How great is the glory of love!"
- "My life itself exists for your love."

1675
01:40:07,208 --> 01:40:10,999
I've told you my name so many times,
but you still haven't told me yours.

1676
01:40:12,999 --> 01:40:14,048
Masooda!

1677
01:40:16,374 --> 01:40:17,755
Oh my, she's Masooda!

1678
01:40:18,083 --> 01:40:18,999
[firecracker blast]

1679
01:40:20,374 --> 01:40:22,874
[music mutes voices]

1680
01:40:24,285 --> 01:40:25,166
Do you know?

1681
01:40:25,333 --> 01:40:28,166
How badly I loved that girl,
and she dumped me!

1682
01:40:29,666 --> 01:40:34,625
"You and I in love..."

1683
01:40:35,876 --> 01:40:37,635
"What more could we possibly
ask for than this?"

1684
01:40:37,792 --> 01:40:38,999
- What is that?
- Sambar.

1685
01:40:39,084 --> 01:40:40,029
Get me Rasam.

1686
01:40:41,750 --> 01:40:43,781
HEY!
Get me sambar!

1687
01:40:44,583 --> 01:40:46,957
He! Do you care more about
that snacks shop than me?

1688
01:40:47,166 --> 01:40:47,833
Hell with him!

1689
01:40:56,249 --> 01:41:00,083
You look so beautiful while
eating a banana without blabbering.

1690
01:41:00,957 --> 01:41:02,208
- Well, I look...
- Stop it!

1691
01:41:02,291 --> 01:41:05,041
If you talk, I get irritated.
All my feelings will disappear.

1692
01:41:05,750 --> 01:41:07,957
If you promise you
won't talk anymore,

1693
01:41:08,583 --> 01:41:10,208
let's get married and start
our family right away.

1694
01:41:10,458 --> 01:41:12,999
Actually, they say I was destined to
be my brother-in-law's wife from birth.

1695
01:41:13,583 --> 01:41:16,583
How many more will he marry?
He's already fixed with Maaya, right?

1696
01:41:16,792 --> 01:41:17,792
What'll you do then?

1697
01:41:17,999 --> 01:41:18,792
I know, boy!

1698
01:41:19,083 --> 01:41:21,500
That is why...
I'll marry someone from America.

1699
01:41:21,874 --> 01:41:23,750
Yeah, do that.
He'll dump you once you land there.

1700
01:41:23,874 --> 01:41:25,708
Then you can sell
Lekhya Pickles on the streets.

1701
01:41:25,833 --> 01:41:27,750
No one buys you for expensive
prices, then you realize.

1702
01:41:27,833 --> 01:41:29,708
Why are you blabbering like this?

1703
01:41:31,291 --> 01:41:33,166
What, me blabbering like hell?

1704
01:41:34,708 --> 01:41:36,500
Dad, tomorrow Samaikya's family is going
to Antarvedi Temple.

1705
01:41:36,833 --> 01:41:37,916
They asked me to come.

1706
01:41:38,166 --> 01:41:39,124
Can I go there?

1707
01:41:55,166 --> 01:41:57,249
[muted voices]

1708
01:42:25,833 --> 01:42:26,957
Father is a Hindu.

1709
01:42:27,166 --> 01:42:27,916
Mother is a Muslim.

1710
01:42:28,458 --> 01:42:29,333
Daughter-in-law is a Christian.

1711
01:42:29,833 --> 01:42:32,041
What a remarkable family
for the whole nation, man.

1712
01:42:32,750 --> 01:42:34,265
He's a lucky man.

1713
01:42:34,708 --> 01:42:38,416
He got a sickler family after
I sacrificed Maaya for him.

1714
01:42:40,291 --> 01:42:43,333
What's with that stare? You won't
get married even he sacrifices!

1715
01:42:44,666 --> 01:42:49,708
The union of hearts
Is the most beautiful bond

1716
01:42:50,249 --> 01:42:54,792
What do religion or caste differences
Have to do with love?

1717
01:42:54,957 --> 01:42:55,583
This is Sangamam, a confluence.

1718
01:42:56,333 --> 01:42:58,291
This is where the
Godavari flows into the sea.

1719
01:42:58,708 --> 01:43:00,291
Nature is so strange, isn't it?

1720
01:43:00,833 --> 01:43:03,416
Fresh water and
salt water are different...

1721
01:43:03,792 --> 01:43:05,166
yet they flow together.

1722
01:43:06,124 --> 01:43:09,124
If humans are united as
one without any differences...

1723
01:43:09,625 --> 01:43:11,166
there will be no religious
differences, right?

1724
01:43:11,916 --> 01:43:13,916
That's what I love about you, dear.

1725
01:43:14,625 --> 01:43:17,124
You see everyone and everything as equal.

1726
01:43:18,541 --> 01:43:23,666
- The truest and purest light
- Shines only because of love

1727
01:43:23,750 --> 01:43:26,458
That light should become the
steps of a couple...

1728
01:43:26,625 --> 01:43:29,666
Moving forward together
with every step

1729
01:43:29,957 --> 01:43:32,750
[music mutes voices]

1730
01:43:35,500 --> 01:43:41,041
You for me, and I for you,
Love lives between the two of us

1731
01:43:41,583 --> 01:43:44,541
What more could
we possibly ask for than this?

1732
01:43:50,041 --> 01:43:52,792
Dad, I want to tell you something.

1733
01:43:54,666 --> 01:43:57,374
- I also want to tell you something.
- Then say it.

1734
01:43:57,625 --> 01:43:59,124
Jhansi, get me the phone.

1735
01:44:03,583 --> 01:44:04,374
How he's looking, dear?

1736
01:44:06,208 --> 01:44:06,999
He is Varun, dear.

1737
01:44:07,792 --> 01:44:10,135
You know my colleague
Das, right? He is his son.

1738
01:44:10,874 --> 01:44:12,291
He did his studies very well.

1739
01:44:13,083 --> 01:44:14,166
He got a job in the Railways.

1740
01:44:14,500 --> 01:44:17,583
90,000 salary, a good
match for us, dear.

1741
01:44:18,874 --> 01:44:21,208
If you agree, I'll
ask them to come.

1742
01:44:25,083 --> 01:44:27,124
I'm in love with a guy, dad.

1743
01:44:36,208 --> 01:44:38,249
- Well, dear...
- Hey, what the heck you are talking?

1744
01:44:38,500 --> 01:44:40,916
- Hey, what the heck are you saying?
- Hold on, Jhansi!

1745
01:44:41,083 --> 01:44:43,333
Go and get some water.
Go!

1746
01:44:46,166 --> 01:44:46,957
Dear!

1747
01:44:47,874 --> 01:44:49,583
Come here and sit down.

1748
01:44:55,792 --> 01:44:56,541
Have it, dear.

1749
01:44:58,083 --> 01:44:58,916
Come on, have some.

1750
01:45:03,291 --> 01:45:04,333
What's his name, dear?

1751
01:45:07,208 --> 01:45:07,874
Tell me, dear.

1752
01:45:10,374 --> 01:45:14,416
He's Raju! You dropped me at
Velpuru for my friend's engagement, right!

1753
01:45:14,957 --> 01:45:19,124
That's his home!
I want to marry Raju, dad.

1754
01:45:19,874 --> 01:45:20,957
That too only with your approval.

1755
01:45:23,416 --> 01:45:24,416
What he do for living?

1756
01:45:25,416 --> 01:45:26,416
Auto driver, dad.

1757
01:45:26,750 --> 01:45:29,249
- You are in love with a mere auto driver.
- Hold on, Jhansi!

1758
01:45:29,333 --> 01:45:31,500
Hold on, Jhansi!
I'm talking with her, right!

1759
01:45:31,792 --> 01:45:32,812
Just stop.

1760
01:45:39,416 --> 01:45:41,115
What's his educational qualification?

1761
01:45:41,999 --> 01:45:43,989
He discontinued his
studies after Class 10.

1762
01:45:46,402 --> 01:45:47,945
A Class 10 guy?

1763
01:45:48,627 --> 01:45:50,935
But he is capable of surviving even
without being well educated, Dad.

1764
01:45:51,124 --> 01:45:53,020
He doesn't have any bad habits!

1765
01:45:53,124 --> 01:45:54,500
He's a hardworker.

1766
01:45:54,708 --> 01:45:57,208
He will take care of his loved ones!

1767
01:45:59,625 --> 01:46:01,208
What does his parents do?

1768
01:46:01,666 --> 01:46:03,669
His father does farming on lease.

1769
01:46:03,957 --> 01:46:06,506
His mother is just like my mom too.

1770
01:46:06,957 --> 01:46:09,458
I can see a good future
with the guy that I opted for.

1771
01:46:11,083 --> 01:46:12,640
Varun earns well.

1772
01:46:13,708 --> 01:46:16,291
Varun will take
good care of you too.

1773
01:46:17,708 --> 01:46:19,464
And coming to Raju...

1774
01:46:19,957 --> 01:46:22,458
I can see only problems.

1775
01:46:24,416 --> 01:46:27,625
You studied so well,
and how you will adjust yourself there?

1776
01:46:30,333 --> 01:46:32,124
People say love makes you lose everything.

1777
01:46:32,874 --> 01:46:35,041
But because of Raju, I'm
focusing more on my studies.

1778
01:46:35,458 --> 01:46:37,083
I'm being more responsible, now.

1779
01:46:38,708 --> 01:46:41,500
Infact, I feel,
Raju and You, are same

1780
01:46:42,583 --> 01:46:44,708
The way you love me with all your heart...

1781
01:46:45,249 --> 01:46:46,874
even Raju does the same.

1782
01:46:47,833 --> 01:46:50,874
I strongly believing that my future
will be good if I stay with him, dad.

1783
01:46:51,166 --> 01:46:54,083
For mysake, just talk to Raju once.

1784
01:46:55,208 --> 01:46:57,083
Your opinion will also be changed

1785
01:46:57,792 --> 01:47:00,124
Even then, if you feel Raju
is not the right match for me...

1786
01:47:00,957 --> 01:47:03,291
I'll agree to your decisio, Dad.

1787
01:47:08,333 --> 01:47:11,083
Okay, dear. I'll meet him
since you're asking me to.

1788
01:47:13,750 --> 01:47:15,276
Ask him to meet me.

1789
01:47:17,041 --> 01:47:19,166
- Thank you, dad.
- My little girl.

1790
01:47:21,041 --> 01:47:22,153
Calm down, dear.

1791
01:47:26,083 --> 01:47:28,041
Look how red your face
turned with your crying!

1792
01:47:28,333 --> 01:47:29,583
And your cheeks got crushed.

1793
01:47:29,916 --> 01:47:32,374
Go wash your face, eat
something, and sleep peacefully.

1794
01:47:32,541 --> 01:47:33,249
- Okay, dad.
- Go.

1795
01:47:33,583 --> 01:47:35,625
Jhansi, serve her food.

1796
01:47:36,916 --> 01:47:37,929
Go, dear.

1797
01:47:38,999 --> 01:47:40,419
I haven't done
anything wrong, Mom.

1798
01:47:44,124 --> 01:47:46,725
Go freshen up, then
you'll have some food!

1799
01:48:00,708 --> 01:48:02,957
- Hop in!
- What, sister? Didn't brother-in-law come?

1800
01:48:03,750 --> 01:48:06,291
Tell him. He'll be on
cloud nine! Okay?

1801
01:48:07,333 --> 01:48:09,916
- What are you staring at? Go on!
- You go first!

1802
01:48:10,374 --> 01:48:11,750
It's time for brother-in-law to come.

1803
01:48:21,291 --> 01:48:22,833
I told about us to my dad.

1804
01:48:23,374 --> 01:48:24,500
He said he will meet you.

1805
01:48:24,916 --> 01:48:26,957
I scared that he wont agree for us.

1806
01:48:27,416 --> 01:48:31,874
I told him you're not educated and
only an auto driver, and he still agreed.

1807
01:48:32,500 --> 01:48:35,500
Please talk to my dad and
convince him for our marriage.

1808
01:48:38,124 --> 01:48:39,124
Wait a minute!

1809
01:48:40,708 --> 01:48:42,608
Not educated and mere auto driver?

1810
01:48:43,957 --> 01:48:44,999
Clarify this.

1811
01:48:46,249 --> 01:48:48,124
Asking me to talk with your dad, is fine.

1812
01:48:49,670 --> 01:48:51,256
What if he rejects me after meeting?

1813
01:48:51,500 --> 01:48:53,725
No matter what,
My dad won't reject you.

1814
01:48:53,916 --> 01:48:54,999
I believe in that!

1815
01:48:56,083 --> 01:48:58,291
Will you come with me,
if your dad rejects me?

1816
01:49:04,583 --> 01:49:05,649
Got it.

1817
01:49:06,291 --> 01:49:08,750
If your dad agrees, you will marry me
or else, you wont!

1818
01:49:09,333 --> 01:49:11,713
So, there is no value
here for me or for my love!

1819
01:49:11,845 --> 01:49:13,386
Why are you talking like that, dear?

1820
01:49:14,041 --> 01:49:16,792
I valued your love
and said the same to my dad, right!

1821
01:49:17,291 --> 01:49:20,957
As I know everything about you,
that's why, I talked with dad, right?

1822
01:49:21,249 --> 01:49:22,666
I'm saying the same thing too, dear!

1823
01:49:23,166 --> 01:49:24,874
You will kiss me, and slap me.

1824
01:49:25,083 --> 01:49:27,083
You will hold my hand
and dump me again.

1825
01:49:27,458 --> 01:49:29,500
You are saying that you will
marry me after your dad's approval.

1826
01:49:29,583 --> 01:49:32,166
Oh God!
I can't take this anymore!

1827
01:49:32,333 --> 01:49:34,458
We are girls,
we have mood swings!

1828
01:49:34,874 --> 01:49:37,708
If you dare to say that mood swings
crap, I'll beat you blue and black!

1829
01:49:38,333 --> 01:49:39,957
Why, Lakshmi isn't a girl or what?

1830
01:49:40,458 --> 01:49:43,374
Did she ever belittled me
as I'm not educated or an auto driver?

1831
01:49:44,124 --> 01:49:47,792
She always speaks highly of
me like she's possessed. Why?

1832
01:49:48,792 --> 01:49:51,041
Because,
she don't have conditions like you.

1833
01:49:51,416 --> 01:49:53,374
What do you mean? So,
you prefer Lakshmi than me?

1834
01:49:54,750 --> 01:49:58,458
You talk about Lakshmi,
out of context, right?

1835
01:49:59,583 --> 01:50:00,957
Now, listen to me clearly.

1836
01:50:01,999 --> 01:50:04,541
My Mahalakshmi looks more
beautiful than you!

1837
01:50:06,833 --> 01:50:08,333
Her heart is so pure.

1838
01:50:08,583 --> 01:50:11,458
Her thinking was so clear,
unlike your confused mind.

1839
01:50:11,957 --> 01:50:14,333
She won't go berserk with ego.

1840
01:50:15,208 --> 01:50:17,083
[thunder rumbling]

1841
01:50:17,999 --> 01:50:19,583
Conversation is going
away into off topic, dear.

1842
01:50:19,999 --> 01:50:21,957
Will you come and
meet my father or not?

1843
01:50:22,333 --> 01:50:23,957
What do you want me to tell him?

1844
01:50:24,833 --> 01:50:27,166
Uncle, please get Maaya married to me...

1845
01:50:27,500 --> 01:50:29,208
I'll take better care
of her than you...

1846
01:50:29,541 --> 01:50:31,999
I won't let her walk, I'll take
her everywhere in my auto...

1847
01:50:32,208 --> 01:50:33,416
My auto seat is very
comfortable,

1848
01:50:33,541 --> 01:50:35,041
and it has a good music system.
Do you want me to say all this?

1849
01:50:35,833 --> 01:50:37,750
And your dad will like
me after seeing this demo...

1850
01:50:37,833 --> 01:50:39,541
Is your dad a
collector? Will he issue...

1851
01:50:39,625 --> 01:50:41,916
a certificate that he got a
good son-in-law like me?

1852
01:50:43,083 --> 01:50:44,416
After all, he is a mere security guard.

1853
01:50:45,500 --> 01:50:46,792
Why the hell, I need
to talk with him?

1854
01:50:48,291 --> 01:50:50,083
Watch your words
while talking about my dad.

1855
01:50:51,666 --> 01:50:52,792
[thunder rumbling]

1856
01:50:53,625 --> 01:50:56,166
I feel so disgusted
even touching you!

1857
01:50:58,374 --> 01:50:59,957
Nobody is willing to
tolerate it if you slap.

1858
01:51:01,333 --> 01:51:03,083
[thunder rumbling]

1859
01:51:36,625 --> 01:51:38,166
- Dad!
- Why did you become wet, dear?

1860
01:51:38,374 --> 01:51:39,708
Why are you crying?

1861
01:51:40,666 --> 01:51:41,541
What happened, dear?

1862
01:51:42,374 --> 01:51:43,500
I made a mistake, dad.

1863
01:51:45,083 --> 01:51:48,333
Without knowing his true
colors, I imagine him in your place.

1864
01:51:49,792 --> 01:51:52,249
From today, it's all your wish, dad.

1865
01:51:55,957 --> 01:51:57,583
- Calm down, dear. Look at me!
- [thunder rumbling]

1866
01:51:58,458 --> 01:52:01,124
If you cry, daddy will also
cry with you! Dont cry!

1867
01:52:01,916 --> 01:52:03,374
My little girl, calm down.

1868
01:52:03,666 --> 01:52:05,541
Jhansi, get me the towel.

1869
01:52:14,916 --> 01:52:16,625
Hello, who is Raju here?

1870
01:52:17,833 --> 01:52:19,458
Hey, Raju... that's
Raju right there.

1871
01:52:24,166 --> 01:52:25,333
I'll cut to the chase, Raju.

1872
01:52:26,249 --> 01:52:28,666
I agreed for the things
which my daughter likes!

1873
01:52:29,750 --> 01:52:32,166
Because, we both like same things.

1874
01:52:34,374 --> 01:52:36,208
But, in case of you...

1875
01:52:57,041 --> 01:53:00,792
As a father, I wish my daughter
marries someone richer than me.

1876
01:53:02,416 --> 01:53:04,500
I took care of my daughter
with my earnings limits!

1877
01:53:05,916 --> 01:53:07,957
She also only have
few little desires...

1878
01:53:08,500 --> 01:53:09,874
and never expected a white elephant!

1879
01:53:10,333 --> 01:53:13,166
And I'm scared about it that,
she might ask me one day!

1880
01:53:16,500 --> 01:53:19,500
If her husband is afraid of
that issue, how will it work?

1881
01:53:20,666 --> 01:53:24,374
I don't want to regret why I
got Raju married to Maaya.

1882
01:53:41,041 --> 01:53:44,333
I don't even care about
the things like, caste, religion...

1883
01:53:44,916 --> 01:53:46,541
and comments from the society...

1884
01:53:47,374 --> 01:53:51,083
and all other points!
Infact, none needs them!

1885
01:53:54,208 --> 01:53:56,500
So far, nothing I've done
for her has gone wrong.

1886
01:53:59,625 --> 01:54:00,500
I won't let it happen either.

1887
01:54:04,792 --> 01:54:06,458
- [train horn honks]
- [snaps fingers]

1888
01:54:08,291 --> 01:54:10,957
I want to show my
love to Maaya till the end.

1889
01:54:13,541 --> 01:54:15,458
Don't make me show
my anger because of you.

1890
01:54:45,416 --> 01:54:47,249
Maaya must come to
know her father's true colors.

1891
01:54:47,708 --> 01:54:48,999
Who the hell is he to reject you?

1892
01:54:49,249 --> 01:54:50,750
I'm seeing him since my childhood.

1893
01:54:50,957 --> 01:54:51,916
He's like a chamelion.

1894
01:54:52,249 --> 01:54:53,916
He's acting like Gentleman
infront of his daughter.

1895
01:54:54,208 --> 01:54:56,249
Listen to me.
Let's go and expose him to Maaya.

1896
01:54:56,500 --> 01:54:57,583
What's wrong with you, man?

1897
01:54:57,833 --> 01:54:58,625
[thunder rumbles]

1898
01:54:59,041 --> 01:55:02,541
You said you've known him since
childhood. What have you understood?

1899
01:55:03,874 --> 01:55:07,208
Sam Babu is a night security
guard. What that means is...

1900
01:55:07,750 --> 01:55:11,041
That work makes him stay away all
night, leaving his family alone at home.

1901
01:55:11,625 --> 01:55:14,208
No one should even look at
his home when he isn't there.

1902
01:55:14,999 --> 01:55:16,874
He turned that fear at the
border into his own shield.

1903
01:55:18,750 --> 01:55:21,416
That's the face he hid
behind, all for his daughter.

1904
01:55:23,500 --> 01:55:24,249
What did you said?

1905
01:55:25,291 --> 01:55:27,041
Maaya has to know about his true color?

1906
01:55:28,374 --> 01:55:32,256
Maaya is the one who sees his real face
and he's only pretending in front of us.

1907
01:55:33,458 --> 01:55:38,249
He's not a security guard for
that factory, but to his family!

1908
01:55:42,124 --> 01:55:45,333
If you see it that way, why
did you accuse Maaya?

1909
01:55:45,666 --> 01:55:48,957
I loved her so much...
so I made her cry.

1910
01:55:49,916 --> 01:55:51,583
Otherwise, she
would never forget me.

1911
01:55:55,041 --> 01:55:58,874
The day a rape case was filed against
me, she immediately came back to my home.

1912
01:55:59,874 --> 01:56:01,583
It's not about whether I did it or not...

1913
01:56:02,583 --> 01:56:04,374
she came to look after me.

1914
01:56:04,874 --> 01:56:06,416
As she loves me...

1915
01:56:06,833 --> 01:56:11,333
she used to panic that I wouldn't take
her name when she brought up Lakshmi.

1916
01:56:13,208 --> 01:56:15,083
Everytime she asks about her...

1917
01:56:16,541 --> 01:56:18,583
I felt she was indirectly
proposing to me.

1918
01:56:18,792 --> 01:56:19,708
[thunder rumbles]

1919
01:56:22,291 --> 01:56:25,333
After her dad, the only
person she ever truly loved...

1920
01:56:28,333 --> 01:56:28,999
is me.

1921
01:56:31,916 --> 01:56:33,333
Hey, calm down, man.

1922
01:56:33,458 --> 01:56:35,083
Why are you acting like
this? We're here for you.

1923
01:56:36,666 --> 01:56:37,999
Calm down, man!

1924
01:56:54,750 --> 01:56:58,166
In this little story...

1925
01:56:58,999 --> 01:57:02,416
At every following pace.

1926
01:57:02,833 --> 01:57:08,166
Every bruise occured because of love.

1927
01:57:11,874 --> 01:57:15,500
In this little story,

1928
01:57:16,208 --> 01:57:19,625
Midst the teary eyes...

1929
01:57:19,957 --> 01:57:25,083
You are the breeze
that lives within my soul.

1930
01:57:29,291 --> 01:57:34,625
There's no mistake,
or right in this sacrifices.

1931
01:57:34,957 --> 01:57:37,416
Hey, what are you thinking about?
It's morning already, come on!

1932
01:57:37,916 --> 01:57:43,957
Love has bloomed... Love is walking
right beside me... In these silences.

1933
01:57:46,458 --> 01:57:50,208
To make a love success...

1934
01:57:51,291 --> 01:57:54,124
M for maaya and R for Raju!

1935
01:57:54,374 --> 01:57:59,208
Look at this unfair fate.

1936
01:58:07,041 --> 01:58:10,333
I've to blame you love.

1937
01:58:10,708 --> 01:58:14,833
O love, you deserved to be punished.

1938
01:58:15,083 --> 01:58:20,792
Why this responsibility
has to be a burden?

1939
01:58:21,500 --> 01:58:23,999
Why do we need to marry her this fastly?

1940
01:58:24,916 --> 01:58:27,249
Lets give her some time, she'll settle up.

1941
01:58:28,625 --> 01:58:30,500
I dont want to do any
mistake in her case, Jhansi.

1942
01:58:31,416 --> 01:58:33,083
Things will be settled after marriage.

1943
01:58:33,625 --> 01:58:37,874
Why should this couple
carry the burden of pain?

1944
01:58:56,666 --> 01:58:58,166
Dear...
Varun is on the call!

1945
01:59:06,500 --> 01:59:07,708
What does groom do?

1946
01:59:08,666 --> 01:59:09,458
Sam Babu, sir?

1947
01:59:10,666 --> 01:59:12,041
A love between dad and daughter...

1948
01:59:12,416 --> 01:59:15,957
being a girl, I can't able
to understand more than him.

1949
01:59:16,124 --> 01:59:19,208
Wonder which path this love is going.

1950
01:59:20,416 --> 01:59:24,249
The unknown silence
to find the way.

1951
01:59:24,708 --> 01:59:27,750
The doubt that can
even make heart stop,

1952
01:59:28,208 --> 01:59:31,416
is now killing me badly.

1953
01:59:34,124 --> 01:59:35,750
- Brother-in-law.
- You're looking really adorable.

1954
01:59:35,957 --> 01:59:38,249
As today's festival, right,
wear these new clothes.

1955
01:59:38,874 --> 01:59:39,916
Hi, Samaikya.

1956
01:59:39,957 --> 01:59:41,957
Idiot, Lakshmi is right here, yet
you're still drooling over Maaya!

1957
01:59:43,041 --> 01:59:44,541
Jhansi, get me tea.

1958
01:59:45,374 --> 01:59:47,708
It is inhuman, isn't it!

1959
01:59:47,833 --> 01:59:48,833
Dad.

1960
01:59:49,750 --> 01:59:53,583
The truth is visible,

1961
01:59:53,957 --> 01:59:57,833
and reason behind
pain is these three.

1962
01:59:58,458 --> 02:00:01,957
Everyone's taking their own decision.

1963
02:00:02,792 --> 02:00:05,708
The distance has increased!

1964
02:00:06,541 --> 02:00:11,833
The situation is can't able to leave,
despite walking away.

1965
02:00:12,916 --> 02:00:14,208
The rings were ready, it seems.

1966
02:00:15,166 --> 02:00:16,208
I will go and collect them.

1967
02:00:17,166 --> 02:00:18,166
Take care of Maaya.

1968
02:00:19,041 --> 02:00:20,750
Are you afraid Raju
might show up here?

1969
02:00:21,999 --> 02:00:22,874
He won't come.

1970
02:00:24,500 --> 02:00:27,999
He's the one who left
the girl just by your word...

1971
02:00:28,792 --> 02:00:31,083
and how are you thinking
that he will stop this marriage?

1972
02:00:32,291 --> 02:00:37,124
He's not just loving your daughter
but also your love on your daughter too!

1973
02:00:38,124 --> 02:00:41,249
- Mom!
- Coming, dear.

1974
02:00:44,625 --> 02:00:48,833
Since childhood, everything you
have done turned out as good for Maaya.

1975
02:00:49,416 --> 02:00:51,583
Including the decision you've made now...

1976
02:00:51,957 --> 02:00:55,291
I'm believing that it wont
harm her future.

1977
02:00:56,416 --> 02:00:58,874
That's why, I'm staying silent
even in a situation like this.

1978
02:01:00,916 --> 02:01:01,666
Keep going.

1979
02:01:02,500 --> 02:01:05,750
I've to blame you love.

1980
02:01:06,166 --> 02:01:10,083
O love, you deserved
to be punished

1981
02:01:10,249 --> 02:01:15,957
Why this responsibility
has to be a burden?

1982
02:01:19,708 --> 02:01:22,874
I've to blame you love.

1983
02:01:23,416 --> 02:01:27,249
O love, you deserved
to be punished

1984
02:01:27,458 --> 02:01:32,957
Why does this pair
has to carry the burden?

1985
02:01:35,625 --> 02:01:37,458
Brother-in-law, could
you drop me at home?

1986
02:01:37,874 --> 02:01:40,041
Driving auto in this attire
is a like laughing stock.

1987
02:01:40,291 --> 02:01:41,333
- Samaikya!
- Hmm!

1988
02:01:41,458 --> 02:01:42,792
Get your husband's bike keys.

1989
02:01:43,833 --> 02:01:44,458
Hey.

1990
02:01:44,957 --> 02:01:45,833
She's your Rukmini.

1991
02:01:53,625 --> 02:01:55,708
You look so good in
this attire, brother-in-law.

1992
02:01:57,999 --> 02:02:00,208
Talk something, brother-in-law.

1993
02:02:03,166 --> 02:02:04,374
[resounding slap]

1994
02:02:04,792 --> 02:02:07,374
We got him now.
Speak out now!

1995
02:02:07,500 --> 02:02:08,124
My watch!

1996
02:02:08,208 --> 02:02:10,874
You bashed me like as
if I'm peed on you!

1997
02:02:11,041 --> 02:02:13,708
Come on, bash me now!

1998
02:02:13,957 --> 02:02:14,625
The watch!

1999
02:02:15,124 --> 02:02:17,541
- He fell down for our mere blows.
- My watch!

2000
02:02:17,750 --> 02:02:19,625
How is he even fit to be a security guard?

2001
02:02:19,874 --> 02:02:22,291
It will be like this if
you bash me all alone!

2002
02:02:32,916 --> 02:02:34,083
- Dude!
- Hey.

2003
02:02:45,708 --> 02:02:46,374
Hey.

2004
02:02:46,541 --> 02:02:47,500
Are you okay, uncle?

2005
02:03:05,541 --> 02:03:06,374
Be careful, brother-in-law.

2006
02:03:06,957 --> 02:03:08,583
He's my brother-in-law, Raju.

2007
02:03:09,083 --> 02:03:12,041
Oh my, I forgot it!
My name is Kanaka Mahalakshmi

2008
02:03:12,374 --> 02:03:14,208
You can call me as Mahalakshmi, uncle.

2009
02:03:18,999 --> 02:03:20,041
Wait, uncle.

2010
02:03:23,957 --> 02:03:26,166
Brother-in-law...
brother-in-law... hit him with this.

2011
02:03:45,374 --> 02:03:46,708
Hit with this, brother-in-law!

2012
02:04:02,374 --> 02:04:05,583
Hey, Raju... where's the guy who ran off?

2013
02:04:06,124 --> 02:04:09,458
If you admit the truth
by yourself, it will be good for you.

2014
02:04:10,999 --> 02:04:12,041
Or else...

2015
02:04:12,708 --> 02:04:15,916
I'll pay my last time
quota bashes this time!

2016
02:04:16,708 --> 02:04:18,625
- Do you want me to align on it?
- Hey, Sam.

2017
02:04:19,957 --> 02:04:22,249
- Nothing happened to you, right?
- My watch is broken.

2018
02:04:23,333 --> 02:04:24,333
And that boy...

2019
02:04:25,208 --> 02:04:26,833
- Greetings, sir.
- What's up, sir?

2020
02:04:27,249 --> 02:04:28,708
- Is he your friend?
- Yes, sir.

2021
02:04:30,291 --> 02:04:33,083
Look, you asked me to leave
for sake of your respect...

2022
02:04:33,291 --> 02:04:34,708
And he's mocking out everyone now.

2023
02:04:35,333 --> 02:04:37,208
If you don't withdraw
the case that day...

2024
02:04:37,541 --> 02:04:39,541
And your friend wouldn't end up like this.

2025
02:04:42,416 --> 02:04:44,208
- This man?
- He's the one who...

2026
02:04:47,957 --> 02:04:50,291
You can't able to remember?
He's the one!

2027
02:04:55,249 --> 02:04:56,583
He won't do any wrong, sir.

2028
02:04:59,041 --> 02:04:59,708
Careful!

2029
02:04:59,874 --> 02:05:01,291
- What's this, sir?
- Bow to their feet.

2030
02:05:05,750 --> 02:05:07,416
A big blunder happened, sir.

2031
02:05:09,041 --> 02:05:11,333
I pampered her too much
as she lost her mother...

2032
02:05:12,583 --> 02:05:15,083
she roamed with some idiot
in name of love, sir.

2033
02:05:16,041 --> 02:05:18,124
Yesterday she roamed
with him till late night.

2034
02:05:18,583 --> 02:05:20,166
As I asked why did you came lately...

2035
02:05:20,750 --> 02:05:23,416
She gave a false statement
on your innocent son.

2036
02:05:23,874 --> 02:05:26,458
Just by believing her blindly,
without even thinking...

2037
02:05:26,708 --> 02:05:28,792
I've raised a complaint in police station

2038
02:05:29,458 --> 02:05:32,208
After so much chaos happened,
she si scared...

2039
02:05:32,541 --> 02:05:34,458
and she's now saying
that your boy is innocent.

2040
02:05:37,750 --> 02:05:40,208
She made all the mess... and
now look at those fake tears.

2041
02:05:43,124 --> 02:05:46,583
She will be able to see
only your anger now.

2042
02:05:47,500 --> 02:05:51,041
But, she isn't able to see
the love behind it.

2043
02:05:51,541 --> 02:05:52,957
And you are responsible for that.

2044
02:05:54,916 --> 02:05:57,458
We should raise
our children with love,

2045
02:05:57,833 --> 02:06:01,124
so they can speak
freely about anything.

2046
02:06:03,208 --> 02:06:05,458
Look, how she scared by seeing you.

2047
02:06:06,041 --> 02:06:07,999
If she able to see your love...

2048
02:06:08,583 --> 02:06:11,333
she wouldn't say a blunder
lie like that for such small thing.

2049
02:06:12,374 --> 02:06:15,874
Your love and her fear
are on same level of emotion.

2050
02:06:16,583 --> 02:06:20,291
She made a mistake unknowingly.

2051
02:06:21,874 --> 02:06:26,500
As parents, it's our responsibility to
support her and make her understand.

2052
02:06:29,124 --> 02:06:31,208
I know about my son, sir.

2053
02:06:31,833 --> 02:06:35,541
He remained calm while
being beaten at the station.

2054
02:06:36,124 --> 02:06:38,750
It's because he thought
about your girl's future.

2055
02:06:50,458 --> 02:06:51,541
You're elder to me, sir.

2056
02:06:51,792 --> 02:06:55,124
This salute goes to your
noble character, dear.

2057
02:06:59,957 --> 02:07:02,374
This salute goes to your upbringing, sir.

2058
02:07:07,166 --> 02:07:08,666
Even I got to know the truth that day...

2059
02:07:09,166 --> 02:07:11,708
as I dont want to make my daughter
stand among the society as culprit...

2060
02:07:12,333 --> 02:07:13,833
I withdrawn my case, sir.

2061
02:07:15,833 --> 02:07:16,957
He wouldn't do any mistake, sir.

2062
02:07:17,957 --> 02:07:18,750
Because...

2063
02:07:19,500 --> 02:07:22,083
his parents raised him
like a Gentleman, sir.

2064
02:07:23,750 --> 02:07:26,708
It's not just your mistake, sir.
It includes us, too.

2065
02:07:27,291 --> 02:07:28,916
Belittling auto drivers...

2066
02:07:29,792 --> 02:07:31,874
and we got used to look
them as some lowlives!

2067
02:07:36,083 --> 02:07:36,916
- Give me the keys.
- Okay, sir.

2068
02:07:41,957 --> 02:07:45,083
Raju, please forgive me if you can.

2069
02:07:48,833 --> 02:07:49,541
Come!

2070
02:07:57,833 --> 02:08:01,625
Raju, if possible,
kindly forgive me too.

2071
02:08:01,957 --> 02:08:04,625
- I've insulted you.
- It's okay, sir.

2072
02:08:10,833 --> 02:08:12,041
Do you already know Raju?

2073
02:08:13,083 --> 02:08:16,458
He's the one Maya was in love with.

2074
02:08:18,124 --> 02:08:19,291
How could you reject him?

2075
02:08:23,583 --> 02:08:26,957
I accept he's a gem, and
even his family is good.

2076
02:08:27,500 --> 02:08:29,208
But that alone won't
help us survive, will it?

2077
02:08:32,416 --> 02:08:34,374
Hey, in these 20 years,

2078
02:08:34,999 --> 02:08:36,999
has your daughter ever complained
that, ÒDad, you're not taking care of me,Ó

2079
02:08:37,249 --> 02:08:40,041
or ÒDad, I'm not happy with youÓ?

2080
02:08:40,458 --> 02:08:41,083
No, right?

2081
02:08:41,708 --> 02:08:44,708
Which means she's happy with you, right?

2082
02:08:45,374 --> 02:08:49,166
Similarly, she'll be happy
in his house too, right?

2083
02:08:51,041 --> 02:08:54,124
You trashed a guy as
he pissed on the wall.

2084
02:08:54,374 --> 02:08:55,957
He came back and bashed you.

2085
02:08:56,708 --> 02:09:00,083
But Raju, despite you
taking his love from him,

2086
02:09:01,874 --> 02:09:03,416
he still came and saved you.

2087
02:09:13,124 --> 02:09:13,957
Ignore all this.

2088
02:09:15,374 --> 02:09:17,500
In this marriage you are doing
for sake of your daughter's happiness...

2089
02:09:18,916 --> 02:09:20,666
is she really happy?

2090
02:09:24,833 --> 02:09:27,041
or, were you atleast happy?

2091
02:09:32,625 --> 02:09:34,249
You used to get scared all the time, right.

2092
02:09:35,166 --> 02:09:38,916
That how can you fulfill her demands
when they're beyond your capacity?

2093
02:09:39,416 --> 02:09:42,666
Luckily, she picked a great
guy and brought him to you...

2094
02:09:43,792 --> 02:09:44,999
so what's your issue
in letting her go?

2095
02:09:55,124 --> 02:09:57,583
Brother-in-law, brother took the bike.

2096
02:10:02,750 --> 02:10:03,874
- Sir!
- Yeah!

2097
02:10:05,041 --> 02:10:05,957
You forgot this, sir.

2098
02:10:14,083 --> 02:10:15,041
Raju!

2099
02:10:15,957 --> 02:10:16,666
Dad!

2100
02:10:26,750 --> 02:10:27,458
What happened, dad?

2101
02:10:27,750 --> 02:10:28,625
Is he the one who hit you?

2102
02:10:29,291 --> 02:10:31,083
Why did you hit my dad?

2103
02:10:31,583 --> 02:10:34,916
I can bear it if you speak against me, but
I won't tolerate anyone harming my father.

2104
02:10:35,083 --> 02:10:36,874
Tell me, why did you hit him?

2105
02:10:37,750 --> 02:10:39,208
- Sam Babu!
- Do you know what happened there?

2106
02:10:39,374 --> 02:10:41,500
- When me and brother-in-law...
- Tell them.

2107
02:10:41,750 --> 02:10:42,249
Darn it!

2108
02:10:42,666 --> 02:10:44,999
[yapping continously]

2109
02:10:45,083 --> 02:10:47,792
- I'll kill you, if you mess with my dad.
- Dear... dear... dear.

2110
02:10:49,333 --> 02:10:50,374
I'll talk with him.

2111
02:10:53,249 --> 02:10:54,249
Look, Mr. Raju...

2112
02:10:54,999 --> 02:10:56,916
from the moment you rejected her,

2113
02:10:57,874 --> 02:10:59,750
you have no idea how
much pain she's enduring.

2114
02:11:03,708 --> 02:11:07,083
She can't leave you, and she can't
even refuse the alliance I brought...

2115
02:11:07,500 --> 02:11:10,500
I know the pain she is going through.

2116
02:11:11,166 --> 02:11:13,041
Don't you freaking dare
to say a word!

2117
02:11:13,259 --> 02:11:14,187
Dad...

2118
02:11:14,333 --> 02:11:18,290
Yet, how you can decline my daughter?

2119
02:11:21,249 --> 02:11:24,124
- Dad... he belittled you...
- Dear?

2120
02:11:24,291 --> 02:11:26,855
and declined my love,
then why are you begging him?

2121
02:11:26,977 --> 02:11:29,375
- It's a mistake, dear!
- Did you see that?

2122
02:11:30,041 --> 02:11:31,409
My Dad is such a gentleman!

2123
02:11:31,874 --> 02:11:34,876
He came to you and is requesting
you even on the day of your wedding.

2124
02:11:35,041 --> 02:11:38,041
- And he doesn't know your value...
- Dear... let it go.

2125
02:11:38,374 --> 02:11:40,366
- He did it in anger-
- Sam...

2126
02:11:40,493 --> 02:11:42,021
You shut up!

2127
02:11:43,124 --> 02:11:45,291
Behave like outsiders
this is our family issue

2128
02:11:45,416 --> 02:11:47,111
- I will leave now
- Get lost.

2129
02:11:47,374 --> 02:11:49,208
Not you, dear!
Come to me!

2130
02:11:50,291 --> 02:11:53,333
With your sweet heart,
become together

2131
02:11:53,666 --> 02:11:55,458
My dear loving kids, right

2132
02:11:56,583 --> 02:11:57,999
Dad, don't beg him

2133
02:11:58,458 --> 02:12:00,166
I'll marry the guy
whom you selected

2134
02:12:00,374 --> 02:12:01,083
Let's go now

2135
02:12:01,166 --> 02:12:02,632
- Dear...
- Maaya let me speak.

2136
02:12:02,699 --> 02:12:04,152
What will you speak?

2137
02:12:04,416 --> 02:12:07,333
You said, you won't talk when I ask,
and you want me to talk with you?

2138
02:12:07,374 --> 02:12:09,957
You dont even have right
to talk with my dad -Dear

2139
02:12:10,999 --> 02:12:13,792
It seems he want to talk
something, right, let him talk

2140
02:12:14,500 --> 02:12:16,534
I dont like, you talking with him, dad

2141
02:12:17,041 --> 02:12:20,027
My loving girl, right,
listen to me, dear

2142
02:12:20,583 --> 02:12:23,291
I'll talk with him, you go!

2143
02:12:23,874 --> 02:12:25,541
You come with me.

2144
02:12:25,874 --> 02:12:28,957
[yapping continously]

2145
02:12:30,868 --> 02:12:32,861
What a double-game, man!

2146
02:12:33,549 --> 02:12:34,998
Keep going.

2147
02:12:37,758 --> 02:12:40,383
I've decided you are my son-in-law.

2148
02:12:41,004 --> 02:12:44,837
- I didn't get it!
- I'm giving you my daughter, man!

2149
02:12:46,383 --> 02:12:47,904
You said the opposite, that day!

2150
02:12:48,775 --> 02:12:51,107
Why do all the parents
of girls behave like this?

2151
02:12:52,216 --> 02:12:55,476
Because, all fathers of girls are selfish.

2152
02:12:56,553 --> 02:12:59,553
My pride is stopping me to say this,
but...

2153
02:12:59,716 --> 02:13:00,749
I will say it.

2154
02:13:01,341 --> 02:13:02,700
If it's my daughter...

2155
02:13:03,716 --> 02:13:06,466
No one can be more selfish than me.

2156
02:13:07,800 --> 02:13:11,550
But, I never made my daughter
feel bad because of my selfishness

2157
02:13:11,808 --> 02:13:17,599
Because, even in my selfishness
love is filled up!

2158
02:13:17,883 --> 02:13:20,636
In this wedding I'm performing
for my daughter's well-being...

2159
02:13:20,842 --> 02:13:23,966
She can only see my selfishness,
but not my love

2160
02:13:24,216 --> 02:13:27,133
I can understand it in her eyes.

2161
02:13:30,049 --> 02:13:34,383
I failed to understand about this till
Prakash and my wife told me about it.

2162
02:13:36,007 --> 02:13:38,174
You sacrificed your love
because I told you to, right?

2163
02:13:38,730 --> 02:13:43,814
Your unconditional love
crossed my conditional love there.

2164
02:13:46,800 --> 02:13:49,500
Why did these wedding rings which are
supposed to be delivered 2 days ago...

2165
02:13:49,720 --> 02:13:51,720
didn't turn up till today?

2166
02:13:52,550 --> 02:13:55,299
Why should some guy come
to hit me when I just left?

2167
02:13:55,591 --> 02:13:57,007
Why was it you who saved me?

2168
02:13:57,383 --> 02:14:01,130
And why did Prakash come here
and tell me the truth about you?

2169
02:14:01,516 --> 02:14:03,173
This isn't just coincidence

2170
02:14:05,746 --> 02:14:07,112
It's God's decision.

2171
02:14:09,299 --> 02:14:11,508
That's why, Raju...
I decided that you're my son-in-law.

2172
02:14:11,800 --> 02:14:13,800
Go and convince Maya somehow.

2173
02:14:14,216 --> 02:14:16,133
Why are you asking me to convince her now?

2174
02:14:16,299 --> 02:14:19,633
She will get convinced if you say
the same what you just told me, right?

2175
02:14:19,675 --> 02:14:21,341
Oh my, how is it possible?

2176
02:14:21,550 --> 02:14:23,716
If I have to convince her
telling her what happend...

2177
02:14:23,966 --> 02:14:26,410
I'll have to narrate her
what happened earlier.

2178
02:14:26,758 --> 02:14:29,049
And I will end up as
bad man in her vision, right

2179
02:14:29,133 --> 02:14:32,133
It's not nice if a good man
turns into a bad man suddenly!

2180
02:14:32,758 --> 02:14:35,966
So, kindly avoid this one topic
with my daughter, son-in-law.

2181
02:14:36,033 --> 02:14:37,826
My darling son-in-law, right?

2182
02:14:38,883 --> 02:14:42,258
So, you aren't supposed to be projected
as bad man in front of your daughter.

2183
02:14:45,490 --> 02:14:46,740
- I have to convince her?
- Yes!

2184
02:14:50,251 --> 02:14:51,758
- Nice.
- It'll be nice!

2185
02:14:53,800 --> 02:14:55,197
I have a doubt.

2186
02:14:55,924 --> 02:15:00,091
I'm asking this with the shocks
you and your daughter gave to me

2187
02:15:00,216 --> 02:15:00,508
Go on!

2188
02:15:00,883 --> 02:15:03,157
Hope you wont give me
more surprises till the film ends!

2189
02:15:03,508 --> 02:15:06,410
Why are you doubting me even
after I'm calling you my son-in-law?

2190
02:15:06,511 --> 02:15:07,626
Go and convince her!

2191
02:15:08,049 --> 02:15:09,092
Nice!

2192
02:15:10,320 --> 02:15:11,636
- One small help, sir.
- Tell me.

2193
02:15:13,168 --> 02:15:17,217
Could you please ask everyone
in the station to get out?

2194
02:15:17,483 --> 02:15:18,517
With a girl?

2195
02:15:20,649 --> 02:15:22,328
Oh my, not for the deed, sir

2196
02:15:23,068 --> 02:15:24,818
To convince her

2197
02:15:24,884 --> 02:15:26,184
- Convince?
- Yes, sir

2198
02:15:27,769 --> 02:15:28,787
Go out.

2199
02:15:29,649 --> 02:15:30,695
Raju...

2200
02:15:45,141 --> 02:15:46,354
Maaya, well...

2201
02:15:46,947 --> 02:15:48,630
Dad agreed for our marriage, love!

2202
02:15:49,506 --> 02:15:52,227
Wait... hold on for a minute!

2203
02:15:54,058 --> 02:15:55,891
What, dear? What is happening here?

2204
02:15:57,058 --> 02:15:59,417
- I badmouthed you like hell, right?
- That's alright.

2205
02:16:00,168 --> 02:16:01,064
Your Pop...

2206
02:16:01,661 --> 02:16:03,792
I said many damaging words about your dad!

2207
02:16:03,859 --> 02:16:05,078
I remember them!

2208
02:16:05,266 --> 02:16:06,391
You forgave all of them?

2209
02:16:09,144 --> 02:16:10,230
Good Heavens!

2210
02:16:10,600 --> 02:16:13,642
- I'm unable to understand anything here!
- Idiot...

2211
02:16:13,766 --> 02:16:16,230
- I know everything.
- How?

2212
02:16:20,600 --> 02:16:23,126
- What are you doing here?
- Hold on for a minute

2213
02:16:23,516 --> 02:16:24,526
Give it to me.

2214
02:16:25,766 --> 02:16:27,725
Not the cracker, the phone!

2215
02:16:30,446 --> 02:16:31,378
See this.

2216
02:16:31,402 --> 02:16:35,815
He's not a mere security guard
for factory but to his family

2217
02:16:36,974 --> 02:16:38,849
My sacrifice shouldn't go into vain,

2218
02:16:39,018 --> 02:16:40,602
- Think about it.
- Jhansi, get me tea.

2219
02:16:44,058 --> 02:16:47,350
So, you know about your dad already...

2220
02:16:48,136 --> 02:16:49,612
and you acted like this?

2221
02:16:51,516 --> 02:16:54,391
My dad shouldn't know that
I'm aware about it, right, dear?

2222
02:16:55,092 --> 02:16:59,350
That's why,
you keep this one matter from my dad.

2223
02:16:59,410 --> 02:17:00,688
- Shouldn't I?
- Please!

2224
02:17:00,933 --> 02:17:02,849
He says, dont mention it to his daughter.

2225
02:17:03,172 --> 02:17:05,256
and you ask me not to tell your dad.

2226
02:17:05,642 --> 02:17:09,224
What fine actors you both are!
So, what now?

2227
02:17:09,807 --> 02:17:12,558
You both dont know anything,
you are such innocents.

2228
02:17:13,183 --> 02:17:16,974
I need to act as if you
won't torture people!

2229
02:17:17,558 --> 02:17:20,766
- Won't you?
- Never. Oh my!

2230
02:17:21,766 --> 02:17:25,558
- Did he slap her?
- Guess she might have slapped him.

2231
02:17:25,830 --> 02:17:27,099
Well, he's used to it!

2232
02:17:33,977 --> 02:17:37,102
If we leave them,
they will settle in there!

2233
02:17:38,058 --> 02:17:40,683
- Well said, brother.
- No mansion, sir.

2234
02:17:40,949 --> 02:17:42,871
In the same station,
they met for first time

2235
02:17:43,058 --> 02:17:45,266
has to be same station
they have to be locked up till the end

2236
02:17:45,907 --> 02:17:46,920
What say?

2237
02:17:47,191 --> 02:17:49,073
I mean, what if,
we conduct their marriage?

2238
02:18:21,777 --> 02:18:24,553
So, in the end, you dragged
our whole family into your trap.

2239
02:18:25,516 --> 02:18:28,266
What now? Am I really supposed
to call you my sister-in-law?

2240
02:18:32,016 --> 02:18:34,058
- Jhansi...
- One minute.

2241
02:18:35,099 --> 02:18:36,224
Give this to the children.

2242
02:18:37,183 --> 02:18:40,849
Whatever you do for her, it will end
up as a fortune for your daughter

2243
02:18:41,224 --> 02:18:42,350
What's that magic behind?

2244
02:18:54,991 --> 02:18:55,957
You don't understand anything.

2245
02:18:56,058 --> 02:18:57,642
Arrange those flowers here

2246
02:18:57,724 --> 02:18:59,600
Girl, watch out!

2247
02:18:59,933 --> 02:19:02,391
What do you mean?
I'm still angry on you!

2248
02:19:02,433 --> 02:19:04,891
I already apologised to
your brother-in-law, didn't I?

2249
02:19:04,933 --> 02:19:06,642
Who cares about apologies?
You beat him up badly that day.

2250
02:19:06,766 --> 02:19:08,058
Will those bruises just disappear?

2251
02:19:08,099 --> 02:19:10,099
[unclear speech]

2252
02:19:10,308 --> 02:19:12,642
Ask your brother-in-law to hit me again.

2253
02:19:12,766 --> 02:19:14,350
Oh God, that'll turn into another case.

2254
02:19:15,183 --> 02:19:17,058
Hey, get up!

2255
02:19:17,350 --> 02:19:19,558
What are you all doing?
Still haven't got her ready?

2256
02:19:19,642 --> 02:19:21,933
[unclear speech]

2257
02:19:22,183 --> 02:19:25,849
If, by any chance, Raju marries her,
he'll be completely ruined.

2258
02:19:26,016 --> 02:19:27,642
What,
do you think he'll be happy marrying her?

2259
02:19:27,849 --> 02:19:28,891
She's too dangerous!

2260
02:19:29,516 --> 02:19:31,600
That decision rests entirely with Sam
Babu. We can't do anything about it.

2261
02:19:31,766 --> 02:19:34,308
[sloganeering]

2262
02:19:34,433 --> 02:19:36,183
Hey, he's come here again!
Come on! Come on!

2263
02:19:36,558 --> 02:19:39,766
If anything happens to our boy,
this entire station will go up in flames!

2264
02:19:39,849 --> 02:19:41,183
[sloganeering]

2265
02:19:41,391 --> 02:19:42,224
What's happening inside?

2266
02:19:42,350 --> 02:19:45,266
- Raju is getting married inside.
- Marriage is nothing but, bashing!

2267
02:19:45,391 --> 02:19:50,433
[sloganeering]

2268
02:19:51,642 --> 02:19:54,435
Raju and my Maaya and
getting married inside

2269
02:19:54,642 --> 02:19:58,141
Just like that day too. You turned a
small issue into a state-wide mess.

2270
02:19:58,308 --> 02:20:00,600
He turned a tiny story
into a national issue.

2271
02:20:00,724 --> 02:20:03,141
I'll handle this from now on.
You go.

2272
02:20:03,224 --> 02:20:05,058
Stop yapping,
get lost from here

2273
02:20:05,224 --> 02:20:07,777
Uncle, get me the flowers.
I'll decorate them.

2274
02:20:07,897 --> 02:20:08,671
- Hit the cracker
- Yes, let me ask him

2275
02:20:08,718 --> 02:20:09,987
I wonder wom is she quarreling with!

2276
02:20:10,058 --> 02:20:12,099
Karuna, come down
to Tanuku Police Station.

2277
02:20:12,183 --> 02:20:13,974
What have you done now
to end up at the station?

2278
02:20:14,099 --> 02:20:16,849
Maaya and Raju are getting married.

2279
02:20:42,152 --> 02:20:44,069
He made our Oscarrrrr Gang name proud!

2280
02:20:44,683 --> 02:20:46,974
Hey, why are you crying on his wedding?

2281
02:20:47,331 --> 02:20:49,850
Sam Babu took the credit
that actually belongs to my brother.

2282
02:20:50,058 --> 02:20:52,058
Walk properly,
or else the wall will fall down!

2283
02:20:52,141 --> 02:20:53,183
Bro!

2284
02:20:53,724 --> 02:20:57,183
He isn't just a guard to
factory, but to his family!

2285
02:20:59,141 --> 02:21:03,350
Brother., it's hurting!
Jhansi, bring me some tea.

2286
02:21:03,683 --> 02:21:06,724
Because of my brother's sacrifice,
Raju got Maaya

2287
02:21:06,891 --> 02:21:09,141
After all our hard work,

2288
02:21:09,516 --> 02:21:11,807
Sam Babu finally got a great son-in-law.

2289
02:21:12,600 --> 02:21:15,849
A good son-in-law indeed, sir.

2290
02:21:15,974 --> 02:21:18,558
[humming]

2291
02:21:19,933 --> 02:21:22,516
- A real marriage?
- Yes, it's happening.

2292
02:21:22,724 --> 02:21:24,558
What, is it with Sam Babu's daughter?!

2293
02:21:26,308 --> 02:21:29,266
I thought he'd end up just like you.

2294
02:21:29,350 --> 02:21:30,350
Sir, greetings.

2295
02:21:30,642 --> 02:21:32,016
Siddipet Sher Sudha!

2296
02:21:32,141 --> 02:21:32,475
Sir?

2297
02:21:32,516 --> 02:21:35,807
I've transferred you, to your home
place, Siddipet, happy now!

2298
02:21:36,308 --> 02:21:39,266
Sir, is it possible to cancel that?

2299
02:21:39,350 --> 02:21:41,016
What's that, you boasted
about nativity, right?

2300
02:21:41,391 --> 02:21:42,891
When people's emotions are involved,

2301
02:21:43,683 --> 02:21:45,266
there's nothing like nativity, sir.

2302
02:21:45,766 --> 02:21:48,558
Sir, I want to stay here only.

2303
02:21:48,642 --> 02:21:50,016
Fine, okay, man!
I'll do something!

2304
02:21:50,183 --> 02:21:51,642
Thank you, sir.
Thank you.

2305
02:21:51,683 --> 02:21:53,974
Leave it now... Huh?

2306
02:21:54,600 --> 02:21:56,141
Who's this girl,
she's damn incredible

2307
02:21:56,391 --> 02:22:00,516
A lady criminal who killed
her husband for sake of lover

2308
02:22:02,849 --> 02:22:08,016
Hey, Mahalakshmi, get me a coconut
with two straws, for me and to her!

2309
02:22:08,807 --> 02:22:09,475
Darn it!

2310
02:22:09,807 --> 02:22:12,229
Hey, you will end up, dying!

2311
02:22:13,350 --> 02:22:14,807
I'll submit happily, uncle!

2312
02:22:15,141 --> 02:22:18,891
As she killed her husband for of her
lover, won't she kill her love for me?

2313
02:22:22,183 --> 02:22:23,807
- Here
- Get lost

2314
02:22:24,475 --> 02:22:26,475
Darn it, he won't change!

2315
02:22:26,891 --> 02:22:29,600
Hey, want some blood?
sorry, want some coconut?

2316
02:22:32,642 --> 02:22:34,933
Seeing your beauty,
I feel like saying something.

2317
02:22:36,058 --> 02:22:42,433
Every bud would get dipped in dreams,
Every leaf would turn into a rose petal!

